  "A large plasma fuel cell developed for use in ASD facilities.": "一种专为联科发设施设计的较大尺寸等离子体燃料电池。",
  "A lifesaving treatment for those suffering from exposure to Molina Mold.": "挽救那些遭受莫利纳霉菌感染的人生命的治疗用品。",
  "A listing of all individuals currently being transported in cryopod storage.": "一份当前由冷冻休眠舱运输的所有人员的名单。",
  "A little busy at the moment!": "现在有点小忙！",
  "A little closer than I would have liked.": "就差一点我就要死了。",
  "A little forward.": "靠前一点。",
  "A little help here!": "能帮个小忙吗！",
  "A little job": "一点小活",
  "A little of the bash and crash": "一点喧闹和碰撞",
  "A little out of the way, but Bud's is always a good trip.": "有点偏僻，但巴德种植园总是个好去处。",
  "A little retaliation": "小小的报复",
  "A little shaky, but vertical take-offs take some practice.": "有点不太稳，不过垂直起飞确实是要多加练习。",
  "A little slammed right now, give me a minute and I'll get you a spot.": "我们这现在有点繁忙，等我一下，我会给你分配个空位的。",
  "A little town where the winds of change are blowing.": "小镇里刮起了一股变革之风。",
  "A longer pixie styled with pomade.": "涂有发蜡的稍长的精灵头。",
  "A longer pixie with layers.": "层次分明的稍长的精灵头。",
  "A lumpy irregularly shaped moon with an inclined orbit.": "一个有着倾斜轨道，凹凸不平的不规则形卫星。",
  "A main processing unit used inside various computers and electronics.": "各种计算机和电子产品内部使用的主要处理元件。",
  "A mining facility owned and operated by ArcCorp.": "一座弧光集团运营的矿产设施。",
  "A mining facility owned and operated by Shubin Interstellar.": "一处由舒宾星际拥有并运营的采矿设施。",
  "A mixed collection of commodities obtained by mining": "在采矿过程中获得的各种产出的集合。",
  "A mohawk featuring completely buzzed sides.": "两边完全剃短的莫霍克发型。",
  "A new fighter has entered the ring.": "一位新的斗士进场。",
  "A new player has joined your team.": "一名新玩家加入了您的团队。",
  "A pack of Nine Tail kopion have your scent. Don't let them pin you down.": "有一组九尾的寇骈犬闻到了你的气味，别让他们压制住你。",
  "A paid favor": "有偿帮助",
  "A piece of metal of Vanduul origin.": "一块剜度制造的金属制品。",
  "A piece of plating typically worn by Vanduul as armor.": "剜度通常佩戴的一块装甲板。",
  "A pilot just snagged another checkpoint.": "一个飞行员通过了另一个检查点。",
  "A pixie cut with teeth.": "刺刺的精灵头。",
  "A planet and company unlike any other!": "公司和星球，皆为独一无二！",
  "A player has left your team.": "一名玩家离开了您的队伍队。",
  "A pleasure as always race fans. Goodbye and keep flying.": "赛车迷们一直以来的乐趣。再见，继续飞翔吧。",
  "A poem by former 999th Squadron pilot Lt. Ralph Kinoi": "前999中队飞行员Ralph Kinoi中尉的诗",
  "A portable tablet computing device featuring a touchscreen display.": "一个配有触摸屏的便携平板计算设备。",
  "A pretty good place for miners.": "对矿工而言是一个很好的地方。",
