  "Ah You ready to listen, now?": "啊，现在你能好好听我说话了？",
  "Ah crap. Completely forgot I had an appointment somewhere else. Later.": "完蛋，我都忘了我等下还有个约会，拜。",
  "Ah dammit!": "啊，妈的！",
  "Ah geez! We're getting poached!": "啊，天啊！我们被偷袭了！",
  "Ah hell...": "卧 槽...",
  "Ah shit! Sorry, that was me.": "啊，操！对不起，我的错。",
  "Ah shit.": "啊操。",
  "Ah shit. My shields. That's not good.": "哦草，坏了，我的盾无了。",
  "Ah you'd be a fool not to buy that.": "哦傻子才不下手买这个。",
  "Ah! Dammit that hurts!": "啊，该死的，好痛！",
  "Ah! Navy ship down.": "靠！友方海军飞船被击毁了。",
  "Ah! Someone has a good eye.": "哎！这儿有一位眼光绝赞的客人。",
  "Ah, come on.": "啊，得了吧。",
  "Ah, customers aren't allowed back here.": "顾客不允许到这里来。",
  "Ah, excellent choice.": "啊，不错的选择。",
  "Ah, excellent. Happy to make for you. Please bring things. I make you safer.": "啊，很棒。很高兴为你制作。请把东西带过来。我会让你更安全。",
  "Ah, excuse me, this area is for employees only.": "啊，不好意思，这里是员工专用区。",
  "Ah, forget it. You can't land here.": "抱歉忘了这事儿吧，你不能在这里着陆。",
  "Ah, fuck you.": "噢，操了。",
  "Ah, get out my way man": "啊，你挡着我枪线了",
  "Ah, goddammit!": "啊，*他*的！",
  "Ah, hell.": "啊，妈的。",
  "Ah, hell...": "啊，见鬼...",
  "Ah, hello. It Wikelo. Welcome to my home.": "啊，你好。我是维克洛。欢迎来到我的家。",
  "Ah, it's not good enough. Systems are still down.": "啊，还不太行。系统还是不能运作。",
  "Ah, just a little longer...": "啊，再坚持一会儿...",
  "Ah, look what we have here...": "啊，看看我们发现了什么...",
  "Ah, my apologies. That's currently out of stock.": "啊，很抱歉，那个目前缺货。",
  "Ah, my old friend, it's been too long.": "啊，我的老友，挺久没见了是不。",
  "Ah, perfect. This space should do nicely.": "啊，完美。这个地方很不错。",
  "Ah, thank heavens. We're up and running!": "谢天谢地，我们可以启动运行了!",
  "Ah, thought I recognized you. Nice to have you back.": "啊，我想我记得你，再见到你很高兴。",
  "Ah, watch it!": "啊，小心点！",
  "Ah, we got some new inventory in. Definitely worth taking a look.": "刚到了新货，绝对值得一看。",
  "Ah, yes. The terminals should be able to handle your needs.": "啊，是的。终端机应该能够满足您的需求。",
  "Ah. If you're looking for vehicles, you should go to the Vehicle Terminal there.": "额，如果你在找载具，你应该去载具终端那。",
  "Ah. Somebody came. Up for a scrap?": "啊，有人来了，是想来分一杯羹吗？",
  "Ah. Thanks. I appreciate it.": "啊，谢谢，我很感激。",
  "Ah. This one looks promising.": "噢，这个合约看起很棒。",
  "Ah... come on, come on no, no no please... no... < Scream >": "哦！动起来，快动起来。不，不，请不要...啊！< 尖叫声 >",
  "Ah... great... you...": "啊...很好...是你...",
  "Ah... so much fun.": "这可真好玩。",
  "Ahh AHHHHHH!": "啊啊啊！",
  "Ahh geez.": "啊天啊。",
