  "Anay Wolfe, CEO": "恩雅·沃尔夫，CEO",
  "Anchor Pins": "固定销",
  "And (as expected) my triumph, again.": "（预料之中的）我的又一次胜利。",
  "And I thought I was bad at flying.": "我认为我不擅长飞行。",
  "And I was really hoping I wouldn't have to kill you.": "我还希望能不杀你呢。",
  "And I'm dry!": "我没弹了！",
  "And I'm out.": "先挂了。",
  "And I'm talking to myself now...": "所以我是在自说自话...",
  "And a clean launch out of the gate.": "干净利落的起步。",
  "And a grenade hits the field.": "一枚手榴弹击中了场地。",
  "And a whiskey?": "再来杯威士忌？",
  "And an aggressive start.": "这是一个很棒的起步。",
  "And another one bites the dust.": "你们又少一架。",
  "And another race, underway.": "另一场比赛正在进行中。",
  "And another racer bites the dust.": "我们又有一名选手吃灰去了。",
  "And arm up. You're heading to a crime scene, you know.": "记得武装好自己。你知道的，你去的是犯罪现场。",
  "And around we go for another lap.": "然后我们又完成了一圈。",
  "And as the last gear selections are made, the anticipation grows even higher.": "随着最后一个人选择完毕，大家的期待值也越来越高。",
  "And as the poster on my wall says, 'Bee Safe, Honey!'": "就像我墙头海报上写的那样，‘一路顺风，亲爱的！’",
  "And away we go.": "开始了。",
  "And best of luck with your work.": "祝您工作好运。",
  "And checkpoint. Not a real surprise there.": "又一个检查点，就是没啥意外。",
  "And don't be sloppy. If people catch on to what we're doing it won't be good.": "别马虎了。如果人们知道我们在做什么，那就太好了。",
  "And done.": "完事。",
  "And finished.": "就这样，完成了。",
  "And get a move on, yeah? I need this done now.": "快马加鞭，好吗？我希望能马上完事。",
  "And good luck with your contract.": "祝您合约好运。",
  "And here I thought we were friends.": "还以为我们是朋友呢。",
  "And here I thought you might be a challenge. Guess not.": "我还以为你多大能耐呢，看来并没有。",
  "And here I was hoping I wouldn't run into any more scum.": "我本来希望自己再也不会遇到混球了。",
  "And here I was hoping we could avoid all this.": "我还希望我们能避免闹到这一步。",
  "And here I was just starting to like you.": "这样的话我开始喜欢你了。",
  "And here I was thinking this might be a relatively quiet trip.": "我还以为这趟能平安无事呢。",
  "And here they come.": "他们来了。",
  "And here we go!": "尝尝这个！",
  "And here we go, now.": "现在，让我们开始吧。",
  "And here you go.": "给您。",
  "And here's the chocolate milk.": "巧克力牛奶做好了。",
  "And how about a drink?": "喝一杯怎么样？",
  "And how may I help you?": "那，有什么我能帮到你的吗？",
  "And in case you're curious, the pickup is at ~mission(Location01|Address).": "然后如果你感兴趣的话，取货点就在 ~mission(Location01|Address)。",
  "And it's good. Jata showing some inspired athleticism on the field today.": "很好，亚塔队今天在场上展现出了令人振奋的运动能力。",
  "And it's official, we have ourselves a winner!": "正式公告，我们有了一位优胜者！",
  "And look. Even more assholes.": "看啊，更多混蛋来了。",
  "And my savior returns. How about you dock so I can get going.": "哟，我的救星回来了。赶紧对接，好让我上路。",
  "And our first racer is down.": "第一名倒下的赛手出现。",
  "And our first racer is down. Was just a matter of time until things got real.": "第一个倒下的赛手出现了，好戏才刚刚开始。",
  "And our one remaining competitor finishes another lap.": "剩下的最后一位赛手又完成了一圈。",
  "And so concludes that disaster of a run. Good luck with the rest of your life.": "总的来说这一趟就是灾难。祝你余生幸福。",
  "And stay out.": "待在外面。",
  "And that circuit's complete.": "这一圈也完成了。",
  "And that is how you stop a threat dead in it's tracks. Well done.": "这就是将威胁扼杀在摇篮里的方法，干得好。",
  "And that is why we are still here. Who's drinking?": "这就是我们还在这里的原因。谁想喝酒？",
  "And that racefans, is why nothing's settled till the finish line is crossed.": "而那些赛车迷们就是为什么直到越过终点线前，八字还没一撇的原因。",
  "And that should be it. I'll send along payment now. Pleasure working with you.": "这样合约就完成了。我现在就向您付款，很高兴与您共事。",
  "And that was the final round. Thanks for joining us. We'll see you next time.": "最后一轮比赛到此结束，感谢你的参与，我们下次再见。",
  "And that'll bring things to end here at Astro Arena. See you next time.": "天文竞技场的比赛到此结束，完美下次再见。",
  "And that's everybody.": "大家都到了。",
  "And that's that.": "就到这了。",
  "And that's that. Let's head back.": "好了，我们回去吧。",
  "And that's that. To the winner: Congrats. To everyone else: practice.": "比赛结束。至获胜者：恭喜。至其它人：好好练练。",
  "And that's the first takedown of the round.": "那是本回合的第一滴血。",
  "And that's why in racing we have the saying, \"ships don't win pretty.\"": "这就是为什么在比赛中我们有这样的说法：“飞船可不能赢得漂亮。”",
  "And the Qualifier is kicked off.": "预选赛拉开帷幕。",
  "And the ball goes to Angeli. The timing couldn't be better for them.": "球权交给了安吉利队，这对他们来说是天赐良机。",
  "And the ball goes to Jata. The timing couldn't be better for them.": "球权交给了亚塔队，这对他们来说是天赐良机。",
  "And the ball is knocked farther down field.": "球被打到了更远的地方。",
  "And the ball is passed.": "球被传了出去。",
  "And the gates are shutting. Let's do this.": "大门正在关闭，让我们开始吧。",
  "And the round comes to end.": "本轮比赛结束。",
  "And the ships clear a lap.": "飞船又飞了一圈。",
  "And then what?": "之后呢？",
  "And there we go. Topped off and ready to fly. Thanks for all your hard work.": "好了，这就成了。油加满了，随时可以起飞。谢谢你忙前忙后。",
  "And there you are. Great.": "你来了，太好了。",
  "And there you go. You've officially arrived. Have a great time.": "好了，你这就算正式抵达了。祝你玩得愉快。",
  "And there's the start.": "现在开始了。",
  "And they're leaving... without their order... great.": "然后他们就走了...也不管点的单了...真好。",
  "And this is what happens when you meet people over the spectrum ...": "你和光谱上的疯子见面就会是现在这样...",
  "And we got a bounce...": "球弹了一下……",
  "And we're done. Wasn't too bad, right?": "我们搞定了，还不赖吧。",
  "And we're off. DefenseCon is open for business.": "好了，防务展现已开放。",
  "And with that first takedown, things are heating up.": "第一次击倒出现了，事情变得越来越复杂了。",
  "And with that lap, the end draws near.": "最后一圈了，比赛即将结束。",
  "And with that, our work here is done.": "这样，我们这里的工作就完成了。",
  "And... Done. Welcome to Levski.": "成功着陆，欢迎来到列夫斯基。",
  "And... There. Hangar assigned.": "机库已指定。",
  "And... There. Landing pad assigned.": "然后……好了。分配停机坪。",
  "And... clear.": "然后...一切就绪。",
  "And... now there is a pilot flying in the wrong direction.": "现在...有一个飞行员正在向错误的方向飞行。",
  "And... we're done.": "然后... 就此结束。",
  "And... we're done. All right, let's get ready for the next one. Okay?": "然后……结束了。好了，开始准备下一场吧。如何？",
  "And......": "然后……",
  "And?": "然后呢？",
