  "Andes Kello": "安德斯·凯洛",
  "Angeli _ Jata move in and knock the ball back.": "安吉利队_亚塔队将球打了回去。",
  "Angeli ganks the ball mid-play. Nice steal.": "安吉利队的球在中场被抢断了，漂亮的抢球。",
  "Angeli getting a little bit physical with the ball.": "安吉利队带球时有些身体接触。",
  "Angeli has gained possesion.": "安吉利队控球。",
  "Angeli moving the ball steadily across the field.": "安吉利队稳稳地把球传过了球场。",
  "Angeli must be holding their breath. I smell a goal in the next play.": "安吉利队现在一定屏住了呼吸，我已经闻到下一次进球的味道了。",
