  "Another Attempt at Red Wind Delivery": "再试试红风物流",
  "Another Challenge to be Removed": "另一个需要消除的挑战",
  "Another Chance to Impress": "证明自己的时刻",
  "Another Chance to Prove Your Mettle": "另一个证明你勇气的机会",
  "Another Idris just got ghosted.": "另一艘伊德里斯被干掉了。",
  "Another bounty came over the spec if you're interested. Have a look.": "如果您有兴趣，另一项悬赏也在规格范围内。看看吧。",
  "Another chekpoint taken. NIcely done.": "又通过一个检查点，干得漂亮。",
  "Another chekpoint taken. Nicely done.": "又通过一个检查点，干得漂亮。",
  "Another combatant down.": "又一名战斗员倒下了",
  "Another competitor falls.": "又一个竞争对手倒下了。",
  "Another contract failed... why am I not surprised?": "又一个合约没有完成，我怎么就不惊讶呢？",
  "Another day in paradise, right?": "又是美好的一天，对吧?",
  "Another day in the grind. You know what I mean?": "又是煎熬的一天。你懂我意思吧？",
  "Another disappointment!": "又一次的失望！",
  "Another drink, please.": "再来一杯，谢谢。",
  "Another game of Team Elimination is over.": "又一场团队淘汰赛结束了。",
  "Another gutless backstabber, big surprise there.": "又一个怂包小人，真是个惊喜。",
  "Another job's popped up. Thought you'd be a good fit.": "又有一份新工作，我觉得你很合适。",
  "Another lap finished.": "又是一圈。",
  "Another lap in the log.": "又跑完一圈。",
  "Another marker incoming. Get ready.": "下一个检查点就要出现了，准备好。",
  "Another of our ships went down. We need to be more careful out there.": "我们又一艘飞船被击落了。我们需要加倍小心。",
  "Another one down. We're getting into a downright brawl here.": "又有一名选手倒下了，比赛正在变成一场激烈的斗殴。",
  "Another one down? Really?": "又倒下一个？真的吗？",
  "Another point for our team.": "我们队又获得一分。",
  "Another request from the Nine Tails came in.": "又一个九尾的活儿来了。",
  "Another ring cleared.": "新的一圈开始了。",
  "Another round kicking off.": "又一轮比赛开始了。",
  "Another round, please.": "再来一杯，谢谢。",
  "Another round?": "再来一轮？",
  "Another ship in the array taken out. Good shooting.": "另一艘阵列里的船只被击毁了。打得漂亮。",
  "Another show like that and I'm gonna get out of here.": "要是再出现这样的情况，我就要走了。",
  "Another thing, the clients would like to know now, so get to it.": "嘿，动作快点，客户现在就想知道结果。",
  "Another thing, there might be some heavies in the area, so watch your back.": "还有件事，那里可能有一些保镖，所以你要自己注意。",
  "Another time then.": "那下次吧。",
  "Another time, another place. I gotta jet.": "换个时间，换个地点，我得走了。",
  "Another time, ok? I really need to focus on finding the bottom of this glass.": "再说吧，好吗？我现在只想赶快把这杯干完去。",
  "Another turnover. It's almost like the don't want the ball.": "又一次失误几乎就像他们不想要球一样。",
  "Another year, another IAE. I'm not sure why I keep coming to these.": "新的一年，新的一届IAE。我也不知道为什么自己年年都来看。",
  "Another.": "再来一杯。",
  "Another?": "再来一杯？",
  "Another? Already? You still got that one.": "这就要加一杯？您还有一杯没喝完呢。",
