  "Any big news I might have missed?": "有什么我可能错过的大新闻吗？",
  "Any closer and you're going to be inside my ship.": "再近一点你就要怼我船里了。",
  "Any fight you can walk away from, right?": "你没必要跟我们打，对吗？",
  "Any idea what that was?": "你知道那是什么吗？",
  "Any interest in making that a combo?": "要不配点别的组个套餐？",
  "Any moment now and it'll be all over.": "从现在起我随时都能干掉你。",
  "Any news, doctor?": "有新消息吗，大夫？",
  "Any security around?": "附近有警卫吗？",
  "Any sign of them? Dammit...": "找到任何踪迹了吗？妈的...",
  "Any thoughts?": "有什么想法吗？",
  "Any time you'd like to make a decision.": "如果你做好决定的话，随时都可以来。",
  "Any time.": "随时开始。",
  "Any trade you can walk away from is a good trade.": "你能放弃的交易都是好交易。",
  "Any unexpected visitors show, you take care of them, okay?": "有任何不速之客出现，你就把他们通通干掉，OK？",
  "Any way...": "无论如何...",
  "Anya Sugari": "安雅·斯嘉丽",
  "Anybody Seen ~mission(TargetName)?": "有人见到 ~mission(TargetName) 了吗？",
  "Anybody can enter, but you gotta fight\\nyour way out ((o_0))": "谁都可以进入，但你得\\n自己杀出去((o_0))",
  "Anybody got a mag?": "有人还有弹匣吗？",
  "Anybody got any friends they can call?": "有人能叫几个朋友来吗？",
  "Anybody got some ammo?": "有人还有弹药吗？",
  "Anybody got some meds?": "有人有药吗？",
  "Anybody lend a hand with these ships?": "有人能帮我处理这些船吗？",
  "Anybody out there. I'm engaged with multiple contacts and need assistance.": "有人在吗？我正与多名敌人交战，需要帮助。",
  "Anybody out there? I need help!": "有人在吗？我需要帮助！",
  "Anybody out there?! I've got pirates all over me. Need assistance here!": "有人在吗？！我这里全是海盗。我需要支援！",
  "Anybody see that?": "有人看到了吗？",
  "Anybody watch the match last night? Keep meaning to check the score.": "有人看了昨晚的比赛吗？我想知道比分结果。",
  "Anybody! Please respond! They're going to kill me!": "任何人！请回复！他们要杀了我！",
  "Anybody?! My ship's under attack. Please help me!": "有人吗？！我正在遭受攻击！快来帮帮我！",
  "Anyone else see that?": "还有人看到那个东西了吗？",
  "Anyone else see their life flash before their eyes back there?": "除了我还有谁刚才觉得自己要死了回想起自己的一生？",
  "Anyone else seeing spots or is that head trauma?": "大家都看见星星在转吗，还是我脑震荡了？",
  "Anyone free to make a couple of repairs?": "有人有空做些修理吗？",
  "Anyone gets in your way, handle it.": "有人妨碍你，就处理掉。",
  "Anyone gives you any hassle, end them.": "有人找你麻烦，就终结他们。",
  "Anyone gives you any trouble out there, you drop them. Understand?": "要是有人找你麻烦，直接干掉他们。懂?",
  "Anyone got a mag?": "有人有弹匣吗？",
  "Anyone got a medpen?": "有人有医疗笔吗？",
  "Anyone got a spare clip?": "有人有不用的弹匣吗？",
  "Anyone like hitting things?": "有人喜欢砸东西吗？",
  "Anyone messes with you, you drop them, yeah?": "如果有人来搞你，就甩掉他们，懂没？",
  "Anyone out there?": "有人吗？",
  "Anyone spare a medpen?": "有人能分支医疗笔吗？",
  "Anyone tries to mess with us, you handle it.": "如果有任何人想来找我们的麻烦，你就解决掉他。",
  "Anyone want to nudge them back on course?": "有人想让他们回到赛道吗？",
  "Anysta": "安内斯塔",
  "Anything I can get you?": "有什么我能为你效劳的吗？",
  "Anything else I can do?": "我还能做什么？",
  "Anything else I can help you with today?": "今天您还有什么需要帮助的吗？",
  "Anything else I can help you with?": "还有什么需要帮忙的吗？",
  "Anything else?": "还要点啥？",
  "Anything exciting happening?": "有什么好消息吗？",
  "Anything going on with you?": "你有事吗？",
  "Anything happening?": "有什么事情吗？",
  "Anything here caught your eye yet? If not, you can count on me.": "这儿有你看上眼的东西吗？要是没有，尽管交给我。",
  "Anything in back I can check out before it hits the floor?": "你是不是还藏着掖着点啥没摆出来的？",
  "Anything interesting to report?": "有什么有趣的消息吗？",
  "Anything new in your world?": "有什么新闻吗？",
  "Anything specific you're interested in?": "有什么您感兴趣的吗？",
  "Anything that you need help with?": "需要帮忙吗？",
  "Anything to drink for ya?": "您需要什么喝的吗？",
  "Anything up with you?": "你有什么事吗？",
  "Anything you can spare would really help me out.": "任何你能给的东西都能对我有帮助。",
  "Anything you could spare would really help me out y'know.": "随便给点啥都能帮到我，你懂吧。",
  "Anything you could spare would really help me out.": "你手头任何能给的东西，都可能帮到我。",
  "Anytime you'd like to help.": "有空的时候来帮帮我。",
  "Anyway ...": "无论如何...",
  "Anyway, I think we're done here.": "不管怎样，我想我们两清了。",
  "Anyway, can't sit around here all day.": "好了，我可没一整天时间在这儿呆着。",
  "Anyway, changing subjects...": "好了，换个话题...",
  "Anyway, hope you have better luck than I did out there. Fly safe.": "无论如何，希望您的运气比我好。一路平安。",
  "Anyway.": "总之这样...",
  "Anyway. I gotta go.": "算了，我得走了。",
  "Anyway...": "总之...",
  "Anyways, as far as jobs go, this one should be quick and easy.": "无论如何，对于这个工作，应该是快速且容易的。",
