  "Attention Required": "需要注意",
  "Attention everyone, we're starting Invictus tours of the Polaris.": "各位请注意，我们即将开始北极星的不败舰队周之旅。",
  "Attention fugitive. You are wanted for crimes commited.": "请注意，逃犯。你因犯下罪行而遭到通缉。",
  "Attention pilot, stand clear and do not engage.": "飞行员注意，离开这里，不要交火。",
  "Attention pilot, your vessel is registered to a wanted felon.": "请注意，驾驶员。你所驾驶的载具注册在一个重罪通缉犯名下。",
  "Attention suspects. You are all under arrest!": "嫌疑犯们，你们被捕了！",
  "Attention to the pilot going the wrong way, you are going the wrong way.": "注意，飞行员航向错误，你走错路了。",
  "Attention!": "注意！",
  "Attention! Laser firing protocol initiated. Stand by.": "请注意！激光发射程序已启动。请在一旁待命。",
  "Attention, CDF forces just took down Nolan Acker on Hartmoore platform.": "注意，民防部队刚刚在哈特莫尔平台干掉了诺兰·阿克。",
  "Attention, Code Blue. Emergency Triage Unit standby. Code Blue incoming.": "注意，蓝色警报。紧急分诊单位请待命，即将出现蓝色警报。",
  "Attention, Response Team report to ICU. Response Team needed in ICU.": "注意，应急小组请前往重症监护室；重症监护室需要应急小组。",
  "Attention, all the event halls are now open. Please enjoy your day.": "请注意，所有活动大厅现已开放。祝您过得愉快！",
  "Attention, civilian tours are now over. Please vacate the ship immediately.": "注意，民众参观已经结束；请立刻离开本舰。",
  "Attention, pilot. After review, your landing permission has been denied.": "飞行员请注意。经过审核，您的降落许可已被拒绝。",
  "Attention, pilot. You are cleared for take off.": "飞行员请注意。您已获准起飞。",
  "Attention, please complete any necessary business and clear the area.": "注意，请完成所有必要事务并撤离该区域。",
  "Attention, security to Nephrology. Security to Nephrology.": "注意，安保人员请到肾内科。安保人员请到肾内科。",
  "Attention, system is overheating.": "注意，系统过热。",
  "Attention, technical support to Zero-Gravity ward. Tech support to Zero-Gravity.": "注意，技术支持请到零重力病房；技术支持到零重力病房。",
  "Attention, thank you for visiting. The Vision Center will be opening shortly.": "请注意，我们感谢您的光临。远见中心即将开放。",
  "Attention, the Bengal carrier is on approach for those interested.": "请注意，孟加拉级航母正在接近中，感兴趣的话就快准备吧。",
  "Attention, the Nine Tails lieutenant on Brushwood platform was just neutralized.": "注意，布拉什伍德平台上的九尾中尉刚刚已被消灭。",
  "Attention, the UEES War Hammer is now open to the public.": "请注意，UEES战锤号已向公众开放。",
  "Attention, tours of the Javelin are now open to the public.": "请注意，我们正式对公众开放标枪的参观。",
  "Attention, trespassers are in custody.": "注意，擅闯者已被逮捕。",
  "Attention, we're officially opening tours of the Idris.": "请注意，我们正式开放伊德里斯的参观。",
  "Attention. Controlled substances have been detected aboard your vessel.": "请注意。我们在你的船上检测到了管制物品。",
  "Attention. I'm in danger and need help. Come back.": "注意。我陷入危险需要帮助，请回应。",
  "Attention. Platform alignment procedure commencing.": "请注意。平台校准程序已开始。",
  "Attention. Please shelter in place until authorities have resolved the threat.": "请注意。请寻找庇护，直至当局清除威胁。",
  "Attention. Security has been notified.": "请注意。已通知安保人员。",
  "Attention. Server Offline.": "注意：服务器断线。",
  "Attention. Shuttle service has now resumed. Thank you for your patience.": "请注意；穿梭机服务现已恢复，感谢您的耐心等候。",
  "Attention. The arena gates are not open.": "请注意，竞技场大门未开。",
  "Attention. The transport of wanted criminals through UEE space is a crime.": "请注意。在UEE境内为罪犯提供运输服务同样是犯罪。",
  "Attention. This is an emergency. Please safely and quickly exit the shuttle.": "注意，紧急情况。请快速安全地离开本穿梭机。",
  "Attention. This vessel has been found to be trafficking stolen goods.": "请注意。我们检测到这艘船上运有赃物。",
  "Attention. We're experiencing a slight delay in service. Please stand by.": "请注意。我们的穿梭机服务将会有些许延误，请耐心等候。",
