  "Be More Precise": "严谨至上",
  "Be a friend and don't use any countermeasures, okay?": "交个朋友别用任何反制手段，如何？",
  "Be a part of the action.": "成为行动的一部分。",
  "Be advised, Dispatch, searching area for possible enemy. Will inform.": "总台，正在搜索潜在敌人。请等待汇报。",
  "Be advised, Dispatch. We may have something here.": "呼叫总台，我们可能找到了些东西。",
  "Be advised, Dispatch. We're all clear here.": "呼叫总台，这里一切正常。",
  "Be advised, anti-air defenses on the Admin Center have been disabled.": "请注意，行政中心的防空系统已关闭。",
  "Be advised, you are approaching a No Fly Zone. Divert you approach immediately.": "请注意，你正在接近禁飞区；请立即改变航向。",
  "Be advised. Hostile is still at large.": "各单位注意。敌方仍然在逃。",
  "Be advised. Hostile is unaccounted for.": "各单位注意。敌人下落不明。",
  "Be advised. Looking into a disturbance.": "注意。正在调查异常。",
  "Be alert. Reinforcements incoming.": "警戒。有增援。",
  "Be alert. There's another dropship headed your way.": "小心，又有一架运兵船往你那边去了。",
  "Be aware that this order has a biohazard rating.": "请注意，此订单含有生物危害品。",
  "Be aware. XenoThreat just took out the Navy Javelin.": "请注意，异种威胁刚刚击毁了标枪。",
  "Be back in a sec.": "去去就回。",
  "Be careful flying through here. It's a bit hairy.": "挺危险的，往那边飞要小心。",
  "Be careful out there.": "在外面要小心。",
  "Be careful, I lost 'em.": "小心点，我跟丢他们了。",
  "Be careful, the anti-air defenses are still active on that platform.": "注意了，这个平台上的防空系统还开着呢。",
  "Be careful. Enemies inbound.": "小心点，敌人来袭。",
  "Be careful. Please?": "小心点儿，好吗？",
  "Be careful. Security could be all over that location.": "务必小心。那里可能到处都是安保人员。",
  "Be good.": "祝你平安。",
  "Be healed!": "治好自己！",
  "Be on alert. There are sniper nests nearby.": "警戒。附近有狙击手据点。",
  "Be on the lookout for anything suspicious. Can't be too careful.": "时刻警惕可疑情况，小心驶得万年船。",
  "Be ready for a scrap. I'm not expecting this one to go smoothly.": "准备好面对一些人渣，我不指望这会十分顺利。",
  "Be right back.": "马上回来。",
  "Be right there!": "待在那里！",
  "Be right with you.": "马上过去找你。",
  "Be safe out there, okay.": "注意安全，好嘛。",
  "Be safe.": "保重。",
  "Be sure to align your fuel nozzle with the front of the client's ship.": "请务必将燃料喷嘴对准客户飞船的船首。",
  "Be sure to check everyone. Can't affor a repeat of what happened last time.": "务必检查所有人，绝不能重蹈上次的覆辙。",
  "Be sure to keep in mind that this job has a firm deadline. Not much wiggle room.": "一定要记住，这项工作是有明确时限的。没有什么回旋的余地。",
  "Be sure to read it over carefully": "一定要仔仔细细地看一遍。",
  "Be the first to arrive at Checkpoint ~mission(CheckpointCount) to capture it.": "第一个到达检查点 ~mission(CheckpointCount) 以夺下它。",
  "Be the first to destroy Checkpoint ~mission(CheckpointCount) to capture it.": "第一个摧毁检查点 ~mission(CheckpointCount) 来获得点数。",
  "Be with you in a minute.": "稍等一下。",
