  "Can I help you in some other way?": "我能帮您什么忙吗？",
  "Can I help you with anything else?": "还有什么需要帮忙的吗？",
  "Can I help you with something?": "有什么事我能帮助您吗？",
  "Can I help you?": "我能帮到您吗？",
  "Can I just say, you are worth every credit. That was... that was incredible.": "我只能说，这钱付得值。刚刚太精彩了。",
  "Can anybody cover me?": "有人掩护下我吗？",
  "Can anybody hear me? I need help.": "有人吗？我需要帮助。",
  "Can anybody hear me?! I'm under attack and need help.": "有人能听到吗？我正遭受攻击，需要帮助。",
  "Can anyone cover me?": "有没有人能掩护我？",
  "Can anyone give me a hand over here?": "谁能帮我一下？",
  "Can anyone grab me an extra DB-4?": "谁能帮我多拿一份DB-4？",
  "Can be processed at refineries into Construction Material.": "可在精炼厂加工成建筑材料。",
  "Can build weapon for you now, yes. Hold and will have soon.": "可以现在给你做武器，是的。等一下，非常快。",
  "Can build. Could be very helpful in your travel.": "可以做。在你的旅行中会非常有用。",
  "Can make for you if you want.": "如果你需要的话，可以给你制作。",
  "Can make for you, yes. You know the stuff I need. Come to home when you have.": "可以帮你做，可以。你知道我需要的东西。等你有了以后回家。",
  "Can prove to be fatal.": "可能致命。",
  "Can someone back me up!": "有人能帮我吗！",
  "Can someone please make sure the pilots know how racing is supposed to work?": "有人可以确保飞行员知道比赛是怎么进行的吗？",
  "Can you beileve today's the day you die?": "你信不信今天就是你的死期？",
  "Can you believe it? A Tevarin senator. Never though I'd see the day.": "你能相信吗？一个塔维因议员。从没想到过我能看到这一天。",
  "Can you believe it? a Tevarin senator. Never though I'd see the day.": "你能相信吗？一个塔维因议员。从没想到过我能见到这一天。",
  "Can you believe these assholes?": "这帮混蛋你能信？",
  "Can you believe we get paid to ruin your day like this? Pretty sweet deal, eh?": "你敢相信我们收了钱来坏你们的好日子吗？这笔生意很棒吧？",
  "Can you do a focused scan for us here? Thanks.": "你能帮我们在这里做一次重点扫描吗？谢谢。",
  "Can you feel that? That's your fear's getting the better of you.": "你能感觉到吗? 那是你的恐惧战胜了你。",
  "Can you hang out for a bit? Just sorting some last minute issues out.": "你能再坚持一会儿吗？正在解决最后一点儿小问题。",
  "Can you head to your deck assignment if you still need it.": "如果你还需要的话，你得去申请甲板。",
  "Can you hear me? Can you? Can you? Argh!": "你能听见我吗？能吗？能吗？呃啊！",
  "Can you help me buy some food friend?": "能帮我买点吃的吗，朋友？",
  "Can you help me buy some food?": "能帮我买点吃的吗？",
  "Can you hold the airlock?": "你能稳住气闸吗？",
  "Can you move?": "你能挪挪吗？",
  "Can you please calm down?": "能冷静点不？",
  "Can you spare some credits?": "能施舍点吗？",
  "Can't believe I'm gonna be the one to take down a big time criminal like you.": "没想到居然是我来抓捕你这个大魔头。",
  "Can't believe I'm saying this, but hostiles clear. I think we're safe for now.": "不相信我会这么说，但敌人已全部肃清。我想我们暂时安全了。",
  "Can't believe how hungry I am. I'm so bad sometimes.": "不敢相信我到底有多饿，有时候我真是狼狈。",
  "Can't believe this": "不敢相信啊",
  "Can't believe this is happening to me.": "不敢相信这种事居然发生在我身上。",
  "Can't believe you actually think you can take me down.": "你不会以为你能干掉我吧？",
  "Can't believe you didn't leave when you had the chance.": "不敢相信，给你机会离开你却不走。",
  "Can't believe you invited more people here to watch you get taken out.": "不敢相信你居然邀请了这么多人见证你被干掉。",
  "Can't believe you're not going to see this through. Guess I was wrong about you.": "不敢相信你要中途放弃。大概是我看错人了。",
  "Can't believe you've evaded capture for this long.": "不敢相信，你居然逃亡了这么久还没被捕。",
  "Can't find 'em anymore.": "找不到他们。",
  "Can't find 'em anymore. But don't worry. I'll get 'em.": "哪都找不到他们。但是别担心，我会找到的。",
  "Can't find 'em anywhere. Think they slipped.": "哪里都找不到他们的人影，我觉得他们溜走了。",
  "Can't get enough, huh?": "还想逛逛，是吗？",
  "Can't give any up.": "我一个都给不了。",
  "Can't help now.": "我现在帮不了你。",
  "Can't help you.": "帮不了你。",
  "Can't help.": "帮不了你。",
  "Can't let anyone in this way.": "不能这样放任任何人进来。",
  "Can't let anyone past without the right credentials.": "没有身份证明，任何人都不允许通过。",
  "Can't let them get away. Come on.": "一定不能让他们跑掉，走！",
  "Can't let these scumbags think they can rob people on our turf. Take 'em out.": "不能让这帮人渣以为他们可以在我们的地盘上抢劫。干掉他们。",
  "Can't move!": "动不了！",
  "Can't really see what the fuss is about.": "不知道有什么好看的。",
  "Can't right now.": "现在不行。",
  "Can't rush a true artist my friend.": "朋友，艺术活催不得。",
  "Can't say I saw that coming.": "我真没想到啊。",
  "Can't see you now. Try later. Bye.": "我现在没法见你，一会再来，再见。",
  "Can't slow down, places to be, people to do.": "不能久留，有地方要去，有人要见。",
  "Can't spare any.": "我分不了给你。",
