  "Come in, come in.": "进来瞧瞧。",
  "Come on and take your punishment. Enough wasting my time.": "快来接受你的惩罚吧。别再浪费我时间了。",
  "Come on in, don't be shy. We're all family here.": "快进来，别害羞，进了这家店就是一家人。",
  "Come on in.": "进来看看。",
