  "Come on! We're losing them!": "加把劲！他们要死了！",
  "Come on! You can't just leave this here.": "拜托！您不能把它留在这。",
  "Come on! You scared or something? Let's finish this!": "来吧！你是怕了还是怎么的？让我们决一胜负吧！",
