  "Come on, bail out.": "来吧，弹射。",
  "Come on, come on!": "操，再加把劲！",
  "Come on, come on, come on? YES!": "来吧，来吧，来啊？ 太好了！",
  "Come on, come on, recharge.": "快点，操，恢复护盾中。",
  "Come on, come on, stay frosty.": "撑住，撑住，保持冷静。",
  "Come on, come on. I got this!": "拜托，拜托。我能行的！",
  "Come on, come on. Let's go!": "快点，快点。走吧！",
  "Come on, come on. Let's go.": "来，来，走吧。",
  "Come on, come on. Pour it on!": "继续，继续，继续，别停！",
  "Come on, come on. You got this...": "加油，加油，你能行...",
  "Come on, come on...": "快点，快点……",
  "Come on, come on? Yes? Yes!...No?": "来吧，来啊？好的？好的！...不会吧？",
  "Come on, do it.": "来啊，动手啊。",
  "Come on, get to it.": "来，开始吧。",
  "Come on, give me a chance!": "拜托，给我个机会！",
  "Come on, hit 'em!": "来啊，干掉他们！",
  "Come on, just let me go.": "求你了，放过我吧。",
  "Come on, keep it moving.": "来吧，不要停。",
  "Come on, keep up the pressure.": "保持压制。",
  "Come on, keep up.": "快跟上。",
  "Come on, let's do this.": "快点，我们走。",
  "Come on, let's get some of those XenoThreat punks off that Javelin.": "快，让我们把那些异种威胁从标枪边上轰走。",
  "Come on, let's go!": "来吧，我们走！",
  "Come on, let's go.": "快，我们走。",
  "Come on, let's hurry and wrap this up.": "快点，让我们快点处理掉这事。",
  "Come on, let's keep it moving.": "来吧，让我们继续前进。",
  "Come on, let's kill this scum already!": "来吧，我们赶紧干掉这个渣滓！",
  "Come on, let's see what you got!": "来吧，让我看看你有啥能耐！",
  "Come on, let's see what you're made of.": "来啊，看看你有什么本事。",
  "Come on, man. You know I didn't mean you. Just worried about the download.": "得了吧，伙计。你知道我不是指你。我只是担心那个下载。",
  "Come on, move it along.": "来吧，继续前进。",
  "Come on, move.": "来吧，动起来。",
  "Come on, open your eyes and hit something!": "老天，睁开眼睛再打吧！",
  "Come on, people, they scored.": "加油啊，伙计们，他们得分了。",
  "Come on, select nearest target.": "来，选择最近的目标。",
  "Come on, show yourself already. You can't be that ugly.": "来吧，让我看看你，你不会真的那么丑吧。",
  "Come on, stay sharp.": "保持警惕。",
  "Come on, there's no need to stockpile drinks. Finish what you've got.": "拜托，别养鱼。喝完再说。",
  "Come on, there's nothing there.": "得了吧，那里啥都没有。",
  "Come on, time to go.": "好了，该走了。",
  "Come on, time to move along.": "来吧，该走了。",
  "Come on, we got this!": "来吧，我们能行！",
  "Come on, we've got a job to do. I'm getting tired of saying it.": "快点儿，我们还有活儿要干。我都催腻了。",
  "Come on, who wants first crack?": "来吧，谁想先来？",
  "Come on, you and me, let's do this! Whooo!": "来吧，你和我，开干吧! 噢噢噢噢哦哦哦!",
  "Come on, you can't be here.": "行行好，你不能待在这儿。",
  "Come on.": "快呀。",
  "Come on. Come on out. No one needs to get hurt here.": "来吧，快出来，不会有人受伤的。",
  "Come on. Come on!": "加油，加油！",
  "Come on. Come on.": "快点，快点。",
  "Come on. Don't be like that.": "得了吧，别这样。",
  "Come on. Don't be shy. Take a look.": "来吧。别害羞。看看吧。",
  "Come on. Don't give up now.": "加油，现在别放弃。",
  "Come on. Don't take that.": "拜托，别偷那个。",
  "Come on. Don't wanna miss anything.": "快啊，我可不想错过什么东西。",
  "Come on. Get back here.": "快点儿，快回来。",
  "Come on. Get the hell out of here.": "拜托，滚出去！",
  "Come on. I need your help here.": "来吧，我这需要你帮助。",
  "Come on. Keep up": "快点.快跟上",
  "Come on. Knock it off already!": "别打我了！",
  "Come on. Let's find who's responsible.": "走。我们一定要找到罪魁祸首。",
  "Come on. Let's get to work.": "来吧，该干活了。",
  "Come on. Let's go.": "快，我们走。",
  "Come on. Let's hunt them down.": "走起。去抓住他们。",
  "Come on. Move.": "快，该走了。",
  "Come on. No. Please.": "别，不要。",
  "Come on. Order already.": "整快点，点东西吃。",
  "Come on. This ain't right.": "求你了，你这么做是不对的。",
  "Come on. Time's a wasting.": "快，时间不等人。",
  "Come on. We got shit to do.": "来吧，我们还有活要干。",
  "Come on. You can do better than that.": "来吧。你能做得比这更好。",
  "Come on. come on, come on, come on YES YES! YES!!": "来吧，来吧，来吧， 来啊，好的！好的！太好了！",
  "Come ons, alls, where bein (Come on, people, where are you?)": "伙计们你们都在哪?",
  "Come out and fight!": "来战个痛快啊！",
  "Come out. Don't make me find you.": "自己出来，别让我去找你。",
  "Come see me and we'll square it away.": "来找我吧，我们来解决这个问题。",
  "Come see me if you need to try anything.": "如果你想尝试什么，就来找我吧。",
  "Come see me in Lorville if you're free.": "有空就来罗威尔看看我。",
  "Come take a look at what I got, just make sure you buy something.": "来看看我进了什么货，记得买点东西啊。",
