  "Enough! We're no threat to you now!": "够了！我们现在对你没有威胁！",
  "Enough! You crossed a line.": "够了！你过分了！",
  "Enough! You don't have to do this!": "够了！你不用杀我！",
  "Enough! You're fired.": "够了，你被炒鱿鱼了。",
  "Enough! You're under arrest!": "够了！你被捕了！",
  "Enough, goddammit!": "够了，他妈的！",
  "Enough. Do that again, and you're done.": "够了，再打我一下你就滚蛋。",
  "Enough. I'm callin' it.": "够了，我宣布没救了。",
  "Enough. I'm done with this.": "够了，我不干了。",
  "Enough. If that want this so bad... they can just take it. I'd rather be alive.": "受够了，如果他们这么执着…那他们随便吧，我更想活着。",
  "Enough. We're done.": "够了，我们该撤了。",
  "Enough. You can't get away with acting like this.": "够了，你不要以为干了这事后还能逍遥法外。",
  "Enough. You need to leave right now.": "够了，请你马上离开。",
