  "Everybody's gonna want to buy me a drink for netting a big fish like you.": "要是我能成功抓住你这条大鱼，大概每个人都会请我喝一杯。",
  "Everybody's got to be scanned. No exceptions.": "所有人都要被扫描，没有特例。",
  "Everybody's got to get scanned. Sorry.": "所有人都要接受扫描，抱歉。",
  "Everyone defend the Javelin. One of its shields are down.": "标枪被打掉了一个护盾！所有人，掩护它！",
  "Everyone here? Cool.": "大家都到了吗？很好。",
  "Everyone here? Good.": "人都到齐了？很好。",
  "Everyone is ready, game starting...": "全员到齐，游戏开始……",
  "Everyone ready to go? Cool. Let's go.": "准备好了？行，我们出发吧。",
  "Everyone spread out.": "所有人散开。",
  "Everyone stand down. We lost them.": "所有人停火，他们逃走了。",
  "Everyone's a winner.": "人人都是赢家。",
  "Everyone's here. Time to get this party started.": "所有人都到了，是时候嗨起来了。",
  "Everything Quiet?": "一切正常？",
