  "Everything good with you?": "你还好吗？",
  "Everything good?": "一切都好吗？",
  "Everything is set up. Expect things to kick off on schedule.": "一切准备就绪，待会儿按计划行事。",
  "Everything look's good here.": "这边看来没什么问题。",
