  "Fine": "好吧。",
  "Fine Payment System": "罚款支付系统",
  "Fine job, my wonderful scumbags. Those UEE pukes didn't know what hit 'em.": "干得好，小子们。那些地球联合帝国的蠢货根本不知道他们被什么攻击了。",
  "Fine! Consider yourself reported.": "好吧，你等着被举报吧！",
  "Fine! Contract's canceled, asshole.": "行吧！合约解除，混蛋。",
  "Fine, but this is the last time okay. I'm not your assistant.": "好吧，但这是最后一次，我可不是你的助理。",
  "Fine, forget everything I said. We'll go.": "行，当我没说，我们走。",
  "Fine, if that's how you want to do this.": "好吧，如果你就想要这么做的话。",
  "Fine, nevermind.": "好吧，无所谓。",
  "Fine, you won the battle. But not the war. You'll see.": "很好，你赢得了战役，却不是整个战争，走着瞧。",
  "Fine, you're so eager to meet me? Then come on in.": "好吧，你就这么想见到我吗？那就来吧。",
  "Fine.": "好的。",
  "Fine. But this is the last time.": "好吧，但这是最后一次了。",
  "Fine. Come back when you actually want to work.": "好吧，等你真正想要工作时再来。",
  "Fine. Dogfight it is!": "好，那就打吧！",
  "Fine. Fight it is.": "好吧，说打就打。",
  "Fine. Forget it.": "没事，算了。",
  "Fine. Guess we're gonna make an example outta you.": "好吧，看来我们得拿你杀鸡儆猴了。",
  "Fine. Hard way it is.": "好，要来硬的是吧。",
  "Fine. Hold on.": "好，稍等。",
  "Fine. How about you?": "还好。你怎么样？",
  "Fine. I give up.": "好吧，我投降。",
  "Fine. I was getting bored anyway.": "好啊，反正我也无聊了。",
  "Fine. I'll just move it for you.": "行，我会把他挪开给你腾地方。",
  "Fine. I'll let my manager know. They'll send you a comm or something.": "很好。我会告诉我的经理的， 之后他们会给你消息的。",
  "Fine. I'll see what I can do.": "很好，我得看看我能做什么。",
  "Fine. I've got other things to do.": "行吧。我还有其他事要干。",
  "Fine. Just keep walking then.": "行吧，想走就走吧。",
  "Fine. Just let me know when you're ready to actually order.": "好吧，您想好你要点什么的时候再叫我。",
  "Fine. Never mind.": "好吧，当我没说。",
  "Fine. Nevermind.": "行吧，无所谓。",
  "Fine. Now you die.": "好，你死了。",
  "Fine. That's how it's going to be.": "好吧，是你想动手的。",
  "Fine. That's on you.": "好吧，这是你自己的事。",
  "Fine. They got lucky this time. Load up and hit 'em again.": "好吧，这次算他们走运。都把弹药装满了，再打他们一次。",
  "Fine. We'll call it a draw.": "哼，勉强算个平手吧。",
  "Fine. We'll take it from here.": "好吧，剩下的我们来。",
  "Fine. We're done.": "完蛋，我们失败了。",
  "Fine. Whatever. Just do what you can.": "行吧，无所谓了。尽你所能就行。",
  "Fine. You don't want it, someone else will.": "行吧。你不想要，总有其他人想要。",
  "Fine. You don't want the job, forget it.": "行。你不想干了，那就把这忘了吧。",
  "Fine. You want to fight? Then let's fight.": "行吧，你想打架，那就打吧。",
  "Fine. You win. Happy?": "好好好，你赢了，开心了吗？",
  "Fine. You win. I'm out of here.": "行吧你赢了，我溜了。",
