  "Glad that's over. Hopefully we can finish up without any more issues.": "总算结束了。希望接下来别再出什么岔子，我们赶紧搞完。",
  "Glad that's sorted.": "很高兴事情已经解决了。",
  "Glad the credits I spent on that missile weren't wasted.": "看来我那枚导弹没有白买。",
  "Glad the scans worked out, sir. Those Nine Tails won't know what hit them.": "很高兴扫描奏效了，长官。那些九尾不会知道被谁攻击了。",
  "Glad to have been of service.": "很高兴能为您服务。",
  "Glad to have ya. Might have to skip the introductions, we got a fight going on.": "很高兴你能来，我们可能得跳过寒暄环节了，要干架了。",
  "Glad to have you back. Get in there and let's end this.": "很高兴你能回来，进去里边把这一切了结了吧。",
  "Glad to have you helping out.": "很高兴能有你在这帮忙。",
  "Glad to hear. Maybe I need to come to work with you.": "听起来不错。也许我该去你那儿上班。",
  "Glad to help.": "很高兴能帮上忙。",
  "Glad to see ya. Go on and give those Nine Tail bastards everything you got.": "很高兴看到你，去给那些混蛋九尾点颜色瞧瞧吧。",
  "Glad to see you all. DefenseCon will be open soon.": "很高兴见到大家。防务展马上就要开放了。",
  "Glad we could do business. Looks like we're both celebrating tonight.": "很高兴我们达成了交易。看起来我们今晚要好好庆祝一番了。",
  "Glad we could find you something.": "很高兴能帮你找到点工作。",
  "Glad you could make it, grab a seat.": "很高兴你能来，坐下吧。",
  "Glad you could stop by.": "很高兴你能来。",
  "Glad you had this.": "很高兴你有这个。",
  "Glad you made it back. I want you guarding those scan ships, clear? Get to it.": "很高兴你回来了，我需要你保护那些扫描船，了解了？那就上吧。",
  "Glad you made it. I'm ready to dock when you are.": "你回来就好。你准备好时，我这边随时可以对接。",
  "Glad you were able to hang on.": "幸好你撑下来了。",
  "Glad you were available to help. Don't know what we would've done without you.": "很高兴你能来帮忙。如果没有你，我不知道我们还能不能完成。",
  "Glad you're on my side.": "还好你是我这边的。",
