  "Go Up": "向上",
  "Go about your business. Just see that you don't interfere with ours.": "去干你的事情吧，别干扰我们就行。",
  "Go ahead and EVA to the control panel.": "出舱飞行到控制面板吧。",
  "Go ahead and beg for your life. It won't help you, but I get a kick out of it.": "继续求饶吧，没用的。不过我倒是乐在其中。",
  "Go ahead and get it then.": "还犹豫啥，买了它吧。",
  "Go ahead and look it over.": "去看看吧。",
