  "Go ahead and start pilot registration.": "去吧，开始注册飞行员。",
  "Go ahead and try to stop the Nine Tails override before it completes.": "继续，看看能不能在九尾覆盖权限之前完成它。",
  "Go ahead!": "走吧！",
  "Go ahead, shoot. The drone isn't going to mind.": "去吧，射击！无人机是不会介意的。",
  "Go ahead.": "请继续。",
  "Go an collect weapon from Loot Container": "从战利品容器中收集武器",
