  "Go around!": "绕过去！",
  "Go dark": "休眠",
  "Go fly somewhere else!": "去别的地方飞吧！",
  "Go for it.": "去吧。",
  "Go get 'em, tiger.": "祝你好运。",
  "Go get 'em.": "去吧。",
  "Go get more meds! Anything you can find!": "再去找点药！随便什么药都行！",
