  "Goddammit!": "他妈的！",
  "Goddammit! Another system down. How about some protection!": "日了，又一个系统下线了！能不能保护下我！",
  "Goddammit, I see how it is.": "该死！我知道了！",
  "Goddammit, I'm pinned down!": "妈的，我被压制了！",
  "Goddammit, another Nine Tails sympathizer's in the area. Marked 'em for you.": "该死 又一个同情九尾的人出现了，给你标好记号了。",
  "Goddammit, okay.": "妈的，好吧。",
  "Goddammit, what'd I say?": "该死，我说过什么？",
  "Goddammit, why won't you leave us the hell alone? Come on then.": "他妈的，你为什么不放过我们？来啊，放马过来。",
  "Goddammit, you really should've taken out that ship.": "妈的，你真的应该拿下那艘飞船的。",
  "Goddammit. Dispatch, send a clean-up crew.": "妈的。指挥，派一个清洁人员过来。",
  "Goddammit. Friendly down!": "他妈的。友军倒下了！",
  "Goddammit. Got a body.": "该死。发现一具尸体。",
  "Goddammit. I want whoever did this found.": "妈的，无论凶手是谁，我都要找到他。",
  "Goddammit. The Javelin just got blasted.": "操他妈的，标枪炸了！",
  "Goddamn bastard.": "该死的混蛋。",
  "Goddamn bounty hunters are like roaches. You stomp one and two more show up.": "妈的，赏金猎人就像蟑螂，你刚踩死一只又冒出来两只。",
  "Goddamn, I thought they were gonna kill you for sure.": "我操，我还以为他肯定会把你杀了。",
  "Goddamn, that's the best you got?": "我去，你就这水平吗？",
