  "Great News!": "重大消息！",
  "Great day, isn't it?": "今天天气不错，对吧？",
  "Great effort in moving that ball as far up the field as possible.": "努力将球尽可能地转移到前场。",
  "Great flying, jackass.": "飞的漂亮，小混球。",
  "Great job on that last op.": "上次行动干的不错。",
  "Great job protecting that supply ship. Captain said it was a helluva fight.": "补给船保护得不错，舰长说打得很英勇。",
  "Great job!": "干得漂亮！",
  "Great job, people!": "干得漂亮，伙计们！",
  "Great job.": "好样的。",
  "Great job. I haven't seen many pull one off on the first try.": "干得漂亮。我倒是没见过多少人第一次试就能成功的。",
  "Great job. That was the last Idris.": "打的漂亮！那是最后一艘伊德里斯！",
  "Great job. You're a goddamn rock star.": "干的很棒，你是这儿的明星。",
  "Great shot sir": "射的好长官",
  "Great to see ya again.": "很高兴又见到你。",
  "Great work. Probably dodged a bullet there.": "干得好。大概躲过了一劫。",
  "Great!": "好啊！",
  "Great, I don't really care.": "很好，我并不关心。",
  "Great, I'll get that hot dog for you.": "太好了，我给您拿热狗。",
  "Great, extraction confirmed. Now all you got to do is bring it to me.": "非常好，已确认提取成功。现在你只需要把它带给我就行。",
  "Great, glad you're the one handling it.": "很好，很高兴有你来处理。",
  "Great, just great!": "太好了，太他妈的好了！",
  "Great, starting fuel transfer.": "很好，开始传输燃料。",
  "Great, that's a win. I'll make sure this gets logged.": "太棒了，这真是个胜利。我会确保记录下来。",
  "Great, you made it. I'll patch the client into you now.": "太好了，你到了。我现在就把客户接进来。",
  "Great, you made it. Now comes the hard part. Good luck protecting our ship.": "很好，你来了。现在才是困难的部分，保护我们的飞船，祝你好运。",
  "Great, you're locked on.": "嚯，你被锁定了。",
  "Great, you're there. Find a spot and lower your signature.": "很好，你来了。找个位置并隐藏你的信号。",
  "Great.": "真不错。",
  "Great. A bloody corpse.": "很好，一具血淋淋的尸体。",
  "Great. And perfectly timed because I've already got something for you.": "很好，而且时间正好，我这里有点东西要给你看看。",
  "Great. Happy to hear that.": "太好了，听到这个很高兴。",
  "Great. I think you'll like that.": "太好了，我就知道您喜欢。",
  "Great. I'll have it sent to your hangar.": "太好了，我会把它送到你的机库。",
  "Great. I'll take a scan through now.": "非常好，我现在就扫描一下。",
  "Great. It'll just be a second.": "行，马上就好。",
  "Great. Last step is payment.": "事都办妥了，就剩交钱了。",
  "Great. Lemme cross them off the list and get you paid.": "很好。我把他们从名单上划掉，然后给你付款。",
  "Great. Let me take care of that.": "好的，让我来搞定。",
  "Great. Let's get started.": "太好了，我们开始吧。",
  "Great. Looks like they're a no-show.": "好极了，看来他们放我们鸽子了。",
  "Great. My supervisors will be happy to hear it.": "太好了。我的上司听了会很高兴的。",
  "Great. Now I have a migraine because of all this bullshit.": "太棒了，现在我因为这堆狗屁倒灶的事头疼欲裂。",
  "Great. Thanks for picking that up.": "太好了。谢谢你接下了它。",
  "Great. That's all of us.": "太好了，我们都到了。",
  "Great. There's more of you.": "行啊，你还有后援呢。",
  "Great. We're docked up. Go ahead and authorize the fuel transaction.": "太好了，我们已经对接了。请直接确认燃料交易吧。",
  "Great. You got your missiles back. Take it out.": "不错。你的导弹回来了。把它拿出来。",
  "Great. You head out and I'll get started on the paperwork.": "太好了。你先走，我来准备文件。",
  "Great. You're back. I don't even remember where I was... oh, yeah.": "棒，你回来了...我们说到哪了来着...哦，对。",
  "Great. Your cappucino will be ready in a moment.": "太好了，您的卡布奇诺马上就好。",
  "Great. Your vehicle should be all set.": "很好，你的载具都安置好了。",
