  "Guess Crusader got their credits worth hiring you lot.": "看来十字军雇了你们这帮人，确实是物有所值。",
  "Guess I misjudged you.": "看来我看错你了。",
  "Guess I should be on my way. Stay safe.": "我要继续上路了，你注意安全。",
  "Guess I should look into it.": "我得去看看发生了什么。",
  "Guess I won't be dying just yet then.": "看来我还没到死的时候。",
  "Guess I won't be inviting you to my birthday party this year.": "我猜我今年不会邀请你来我的生日派对了。",
  "Guess I'll go take a look... I do everything around here.": "我想我得去看看…什么事都得我来做。",
  "Guess I'll go take look... I do everything around here.": "我想我得去看看……什么事都得我来做。",
  "Guess I'm just not gonna get rid of you. If you want to die that bad.": "看来我是没法摆脱你了。如果你这么想死，我就成全你吧。",
  "Guess it was nothing.": "可能啥也没有。",
  "Guess it was too much to hope we'd get off easy.": "看来想轻松离开是个奢望了。",
  "Guess it's down to just us then.": "我猜我们已经结束了。",
  "Guess it's nothing to worry about.": "我想应该没有什么好担心的。",
  "Guess my day just got a little bit worse.": "屋漏偏逢连夜雨啊。",
  "Guess not...": "大概...",
  "Guess someone brought their ride.": "看来有人把自己的座驾也带来了。",
  "Guess that's life on the fringe, huh.": "我想这就是边缘地带的生活，是吧。",
  "Guess that's the way it is sometimes.": "我想有时候事情就是这样吧。",
  "Guess there's nothing left to say.": "我想没什么好说的了。",
  "Guess they decided they had enough.": "我猜他们已经受够了。",
  "Guess this bounty's going back in the rotation.": "看来这单赏金得重新挂出来了。",
  "Guess we can try this again...": "我猜我们能再来一次。",
  "Guess we don't have that anymore.": "我想我们已经没有了。",
  "Guess we fight.": "看来不打不行了。",
  "Guess we know which side you're on.": "总算知道你是哪边的了。",
  "Guess we'll mark that one down as 'to be continued.'": "看起来这个问题我们只能记作“待续”了。",
  "Guess we're done being nice.": "感觉我们没法友好相处了。",
  "Guess we're done then.": "看起来我们没啥可聊的了。",
  "Guess we're fighting.": "看来我们得打一架了。",
  "Guess were getting serious.": "认真了？",
  "Guess what? Got some friends coming in.": "你猜怎么着？我们的朋友们要来了。",
  "Guess what? You're fired. Have a great life.": "你猜怎么着？你被炒鱿鱼了。祝你万事如意嗷。",
  "Guess when it rains it pours. See if you can sort this out too.": "祸不单行，祸不单行。看看你是否也能解决这个问题。",
  "Guess who it is.": "猜猜这是谁。",
  "Guess who's got back up?": "猜猜看，谁的支援来了？",
  "Guess you couldn't be trusted after all.": "看来你根本不值得信任。",
  "Guess you don't wanna be rich. Good luck with that.": "看来你并不想发财。那你好自为之吧。",
  "Guess you finally smartened up.": "看来你变聪明了。",
  "Guess you got skills after all.": "看来你还有两下啊。",
  "Guess you like being shot.": "我猜你喜欢被射。",
  "Guess you made your choice.": "看来你有了自己的选择。",
  "Guess you weren't up for the job.": "就你这也来干这活儿？",
  "Guess you're gonna get a chance to earn your pay.": "我猜你有机会挣钱了。",
  "Guests have arrived. Gonna go greet them.": "客人们到了，该去欢迎一下他们了。",
