  "Hell if I know where they went. But they sure as hell ain't here.": "鬼知道他们跑哪去了。反正肯定TM不在这。",
  "Hell no!": "去他妈的，不行！",
  "Hell no.": "绝不。",
  "Hell of a bump. Hope you're okay.": "我的天啊，希望你人没事。",
  "Hell of a doomsday spread you just launched.": "你刚才发射了一堆什么贵玩意？",
  "Hell with it!": "操了！",
  "Hell with it, I'll kill you myself.": "见鬼去吧，我会亲手杀了你。",
  "Hell with it.": "见鬼去吧。",
  "Hell with it. I'll find someone else.": "见鬼，我会找别人的。",
  "Hell with it. I'll see you later.": "不管了，来日再见。",
  "Hell with it. I'm done with you!": "我日了，受够你了。",
  "Hell with it. I'm just gonna give 'em what they want.": "不管了，他们想干啥干啥吧。",
  "Hell with it. I'm not getting paid enough for this.": "可去他的吧。我收到的那点钱还不值得我这么拼命。",
  "Hell with it. Let's get the hell out of here.": "见鬼去吧，我们离开这鬼地方吧。",
  "Hell with it. Run!": "去他的吧，快跑！",
  "Hell with it. You're out of the goddamn race.": "去你的吧，你他妈出局了。",
  "Hell with that shit. Let's go.": "见鬼去吧，我们开干吧。",
  "Hell with this.": "这玩意太狗屎了。",
  "Hell with you!": "去死吧你！",
  "Hell yeah!": "太他妈棒了！",
  "Hell yeah! Crusader's gonna be kipo surprised when we take over.": "乖乖！我们得手后十字军的那帮人一定会巨吃一惊的！",
  "Hell yeah! I was worried that you'd dodge or something but nope. Direct hit.": "哈哈！我还怕你能躲掉啥的，并没有。直接命中。",
  "Hell yeah! That was awesome.": "太他妈棒了！那太厉害了 ！",
  "Hell yeah! That's one all me!": "耶！是我拿下他的。",
  "Hell yeah! You showed that bastard who's boss.": "哈哈！你让那群混蛋了解了谁才是老大。",
  "Hell yeah, gotta roast those runners.": "哦耶！把那些逃跑的家伙烤成渣！",
  "Hell yeah, people.": "喔耶，大家干得漂亮。",
  "Hell yeah, people. That's what I like to see.": "是啊，大伙，这就是我喜欢看到的。",
  "Hell yeah, way to ghost 'em.": "是啊，让他们见鬼去吧。",
  "Hell yeah.": "哦耶。",
  "Hell yeah. I hope that asshole can't regen.": "太他妈是了！我真希望那个混蛋再生不了。",
  "Hell yeah. That was crack bit of flying.": "太他妈对了，飞得真棒。",
  "Hell yes!": "棒极了！",
  "Hell yes! That did it. We got them on the run!": "太好了！搞定了。我们打得他们抱头鼠窜！",
  "Hell, I might just sit back and let you kill yourself.": "天呐，也许我该坐回去看着你自取灭亡。",
  "Hell, no.": "靠，不行。",
  "Hell, yeah!": "太棒啦！",
