  "Hello and welcome to Astro Arena.": "您好，欢迎来到天文竞技场。",
  "Hello and welcome to Gre- (person shouting) Grim HEX!": "你好！欢迎来到 格林- （某人大喊）六角湾！（格林皇家住宅交易所）",
  "Hello and welcome to Green Imperial Housing Exchange. Would you like to land?": "您好，欢迎来到格林皇家住宅交易所。您想要降落吗？",
