  "Hello and welcome to the Invictus Expo Hall.": "欢迎来到不败舰队周展览会场。",
  "Hello everyone, DefenseCon will be opening really soon.": "大家好，防务展即将开放。",
  "Hello!": "你好！",
  "Hello, Hurston Transfers calling.": "您好，赫斯顿呼叫转移。",
  "Hello, and welcome to Jobwell.": "你好，欢迎来到Jobwell。",
  "Hello, let me know if there's anything I can help you with.": "嗨，如果有什么我可以帮您的，可以找我。",
  "Hello, please come in.": "您好，请进。",
  "Hello, welcome to Garrity Defense.": "您好，欢迎光临加里蒂防具。",
  "Hello, welcome to Jobwell.": "嗨，欢迎来到Jobwell。",
  "Hello, welcome to M&V.": "你好，欢迎光临M&V。",
  "Hello, welcome to the TDD.": "你好，欢迎来到TDD。",
  "Hello, yes. Can you see me? Very disappointing… but you want pad. Hold.": "你好，是的。你能看到我吗？非常令人失望……但你想要停机坪。稍等一下。",
  "Hello.": "你好。",
  "Hello. Can I get you a coffee or tea?": "您好，咖啡还是茶。",
  "Hello. Good thing. Done now.": "你好。好东西。现在完成。",
  "Hello. Of course we can help you out. Let me see if I have a spot for you.": "你好。我当然可以帮你，让我看看有没有空位。",
  "Hello. Thanks for coming in.": "您好，欢迎光临。",
  "Hello. Wait one second while I find an available space.": "你好。请稍等片刻，我正在寻找可用的空间。",
  "Hello. Wikelo here. Will give you favors if you do job. Good. Bye.": "你好。我是维克洛。如果你做工作，会给你人情。很好。再见。",
  "Hello. Wikelo here. You change mind. No problem. Indecisive, but okay.": "你好，维克洛在这。你改变主意了。没问题。没主见，不过没关系。",
  "Hello?": "喂？",
  "Hello? Can anyone hear me? Hello? Oh god. I'm gonna die.": "你好？有人能听见我吗？你好？哦天呐，我要死了。",
  "Hello? Do you want a drink?": "您好？想要杯喝的吗？",
  "Hello? Hi. If you're ready, I'm ready.": "你好？你准备好了吗？我好了。",
  "Hello? Send backup before it's too late.": "喂？趁现在还来得及，赶紧来支援。",
  "Hello? This is your drink.": "你好？这是您的饮料。",
  "Hello? You can come out. We're friends.": "喂？你可以出来了。我们是朋友。",
  "Hello? You need a drink?": "您好，您想喝点东西吗？",
  "Hello? You ordering?": "您好，还点吗？",
  "Hello?! Hello?! I got fighters all over me and need help.": "喂？！喂？！我被战机围困了，需要帮助！",
  "Helloooo and wellll-come to-Grim HEX!Would youuuuuu like to land?": "亻尔女子 好好好欢迎来到六角湾！你想降落吗？",
  "Hello… nice to see.": "你好……很高兴见到你。",
  "Helluva job. Clean up these stragglers and we can call it a day.": "干得好，把这些残兵败将都清理干净，我们就可以收工了。",
  "Helluva streak. I keep giving you jobs, you keep knocking them down.": "绝佳的表现！我一个又一个的给你发任务，你一个又一个完美地完成了它们。",
