  "Hey, how about you ease up a little.": "嘿，要不你歇会儿。",
  "Hey, how are you? Miles Eckhart.": "嘿，你好吗？在下迈尔斯·埃克哈特。",
  "Hey, how you been?": "嘿，你过得怎么样？",
  "Hey, how you doing?": "嘿，最近好不？",
  "Hey, how you doing? You hungry?": "嘿，您怎么样？饿了吗？",
  "Hey, how's it going.": "嗨，过的如何。",
  "Hey, how's it going?": "嘿，最近怎么样？",
  "Hey, how's it going? I think we got some new merch, check it out.": "嘿，过的怎么样？我们应该是到了一些新品，看看吧。",
  "Hey, hunting down some murderous skag. Will let you know if we find 'em.": "嘿，我们正在追捕一些杀人的变态。如果我们找到他们，会告诉你的。",
  "Hey, if you don't return the ICC's property, I'm gonna have to report you.": "嘿，如果你不归还帝国制图中心的财产，我就得举报你。",
