  "Hey, you want this drink or what?": "嘿，这杯酒你是要还是不要啊。",
  "Hey, you want this or what?": "嘿，您还要不要了。",
  "Hey, you work for me, I expect you to get shit done. Not hang around here.": "嘿，你帮我干活，我期望着你去把事情好好的干完，而不是在那闲逛。",
  "Hey, you're doing good. Keep it up.": "嘿，你做得很好。继续努力。",
  "Hey, you're flying a bit close.": "喂，你飞得太近了。",
  "Hey, you're my escort right? Welcome.": "你是来护送我的吧，欢迎。",
  "Hey, you're supposed to help me, not shoot me.": "嘿，你是来帮我的，不是来打我的。",
  "Hey, your order!": "您好！您的喝的！",
  "Hey.": "嘿。",
  "Hey. Back again?": "嘿，又转悠回来了？",
  "Hey. Drink? Yes? No?": "嘿，喝酒吗？喝？还是不喝？",
  "Hey. Finally made it.": "嘿，我们终于到了。",
  "Hey. Get back here.": "嘿，赶紧回来。",
  "Hey. Get ready. You got some hostiles that'll be there any moment.": "嘿，准备好。有几名敌对目标马上就到。",
  "Hey. How's it going?": "嘿，最近怎么样？",
  "Hey. It's Wallace. Got something that needs doing.": "嘿，这里是华莱士，我这又有新活了。",
  "Hey. My ship's dead. I need some time to get it back online. Can you cover me?": "喂，我的飞船瘫痪了。我需要一段时间才能把它修好，你能掩护我一下吗？",
  "Hey. Nice to have you. You thirsty?": "嘿。很高兴见到您，渴了吗？",
  "Hey. No shooting me when my shields are down!": "喂！我盾没了就别再打我了！",
  "Hey. Stop screwing around and finish the job. This is your last chance.": "嘿，别瞎搞了。完成你的任务，这是你最后的机会。",
  "Hey. Thanks for coming.": "嘿，感谢你的到来。",
  "Hey. That is not okay!": "嘿！这可不行！",
  "Hey. What's goin' on.": "嗨，近况如何。",
  "Hey. Yeah, have a look around.": "嘿。对，看看吧。",
  "Hey. You want something?": "嘿，想来点什么？",
  "Hey. You want this order or not?": "你好，这份订单您还想要吗？",
  "Hey...": "嘿...",
  "Hey... I apologize.": "嘿...我很抱歉。",
  "Heya.": "嗨~。",
  "Hi Doctor, thanks for seeing me.": "你好啊医生，谢谢你来看望我。",
  "Hi again!": "嗨，又一次。",
  "Hi again. Your spot is still assigned to you and ready for use.": "再次问候。你的专属位置依然为你保留，随时可供使用。",
  "Hi and welcome to AstroArmada.": "嘿，欢迎来到天文舰队。",
  "Hi and welcome to Big Benny's. Home of Kacho to Go.": "您好，欢迎光临大本尼，卡乔面之家。",
  "Hi and welcome to New Babbage.": "你好，欢迎来到新巴贝奇。",
  "Hi everyone, so I think we're all here.": "嘿，大家，看来我们全部安全抵达了。",
  "Hi there! How can I assist you today?": "你好！今天需要我怎么帮助你吗？",
  "Hi there.": "你好啊。",
  "Hi there. Back again, I see.": "嗨，又来了。",
  "Hi there. Can I help you?": "嗨。有什么我能帮您的？",
  "Hi there. Hello. Thanks for showing up.": "你好，谢谢你能来。",
  "Hi! Is there something I can help you with?": "你好！有什么我可以帮助的吗？",
  "Hi! What can I do for you?": "您好！有什么能为您效劳的？",
  "Hi&Tight Shoes": "趁足 鞋子",
  "Hi, I'm contacting you from microTech.": "您好，这里是微科。",
  "Hi, can I get you something to eat?": "嗨，您想吃点什么？",
  "Hi, good to have you back.": "嘿，真高兴看到您回来了。",
  "Hi, how about a coffee?": "嗨，来杯咖啡如何？",
  "Hi, it's Constantine from Hurston Dynamics Transfers.": "嗨，这里是赫斯顿动力公司的中间人。",
  "Hi, let me know if there's anything I can help you with.": "嗨，如果您需要任何帮助可以找我。",
  "Hi, sorry to do this, but the job's changed a little. Sending the details now.": "嗨，你好，工作内容发生了点变化，正在发送细节。",
  "Hi, sorry, what are you doing?": "嗨，不好意思，您在做什么？",
  "Hi, thanks for coming in.": "嗨，感谢您的光顾。",
  "Hi, this is a courtesy comm from microTech.": "您好，这是来自微科的问候通讯。",
  "Hi, welcome back. Good to see you.": "嗨，欢迎回来，很高兴见到您。",
  "Hi, welcome to Casaba Outlet.": "嘿，欢迎来到卡莎巴服装店。",
  "Hi, welcome to CenterMass.": "嗨，欢迎光临核心区域。",
  "Hi, welcome to EZ Hab.": "嗨，欢迎来到EZ胶囊公寓。",
  "Hi, welcome to Grab 'n Go.": "嘿，欢迎来到外带美味。",
  "Hi, welcome to Live Fire.": "嘿，欢迎光临荷枪实弹武器店。",
  "Hi, welcome to Twyn's Sandwiches.": "嗨，欢迎来到吐温三明治。",
  "Hi, welcome to the store.": "嗨，欢迎光顾本店。",
  "Hi, welcome.": "嗨，欢迎光临。",
  "Hi, welcome. Come in.": "嗨，欢迎光临。请进。",
  "Hi, welcome. Got some great stuff on sale.": "嗨，欢迎。我们这有好东西。",
  "Hi, what can I get you today?": "嗨，您今天想要点什么？",
  "Hi, what can I get you?": "嗨，您需要点什么？",
  "Hi.": "嗨。",
  "Hi. Hello. You're here for the escort job, right?": "嗨，你好。你是来做护航任务的，对吧？",
  "Hi. I'll go ahead and locate a free spot for you. One second.": "你好。我这就帮你找个空位。稍等一下。",
  "Hi. Let me find a free spot for your vehicle.": "你好。请稍等，我帮你找个空位停放载具。",
  "Hi. Welcome to Big Benny's.": "嗨，欢迎光临大本尼。",
  "Hi. Welcome to Grab 'N Go.": "嘿，欢迎来到外带美味。",
  "Hi. Welcome to Twyn's.": "欢迎光临吐温三明治。",
  "Hi. What can I do for you?": "你好。有什么能为你效劳的？",
