  "Hiya.": "嗨呀。",
  "Hm, looks like all the hangars are full. Gonna be just another second.": "看来机库全都满了，你可能得多等会了。",
  "Hmm, I hate to be a downer, but I had to cancel your landing request.": "嗯，我不想扫人兴致，但是我现在得取消你的降落许可。",
  "Hmm, I hate to rush you, but you're kinda taking a little too long... You know?": "Hmm...我不喜欢催人，但是你花的时间实在有点太长了...你懂吧？",
  "Hmm, What? That can't be true. I've been waiting all evening.": "嗯？什么？这不可能是真的。我都等了一整晚了。",
  "Hmm, interesting…": "嗯，有意思……",
  "Hmm, not sure if I want another drink or not. What about you? You want one?": "呃，不知道我还想喝不。你觉得呢？想再来一杯吗？",
  "Hmm, run a focused scan.": "嗯……做一次聚焦扫描吧。",
  "Hmm, that's it?": "呃，就这？",
  "Hmm, this is almost too good. I'm drinking it way too fast. How's yours?": "唔，这东西太好喝了，一下就喝完了；你的呢？",
  "Hmm, we got a parking spot just waiting for you.": "嗯，我们这有个泊位在等着你来了。",
  "Hmm.": "嗯。",
  "Hmm. I don't know... this seems a little overpriced.": "嗯，我不知道...这个好像有点太贵了。",
  "Hmm. I thought it'd be? more.": "额，我还以为有更多呢。",
  "Hmm. I'm gonna guess they aren't here to help.": "嗯，我猜他们不是来帮忙的。",
  "Hmm. I'm having a really hard time deciding.": "嗯...我是真的很难决定。",
  "Hmm. I'm lost. You want me to do what? No. No.": "等等，我有点懵，你想让我干啥？不行，不行。",
  "Hmm. We might have to get going without them.": "嗯...我们可能不用等他们了。",
  "Hmm. Your profile has been flagged.": "嗯...您的档案已经被停用了。",
  "Hmm.. Yeah, I don't have anything for you.": "嗯...是啊，我没有东西给你。",
  "Hmm...": "嗯...",
  "Hmm... I could go with this one? But maybe the other one's better?": "嗯... 我买这个吗？但是也许另一个更好？",
  "Hmm... Let's see.": "嗯... 让我看看。",
  "Hmm?": "嗯？",
  "Hmmm, let me see.": "Hmmm，让我看看。",
  "Hmmm.": "嗯。",
  "Hmm… button do nothing. Give me beat.": "嗯……按钮无反应。等我几拍。",
  "Hmm… have problem here. Give me second.": "嗯……这里有问题。再给我几秒。",
