  "Hold off a sec.": "待会再说。",
  "Hold on a sec. I'm sending the next patrol point.": "等一下，我正在发送下一个巡逻点。",
  "Hold on for a sec. There are a few others inbound.": "等一下，还有几个人要来。",
  "Hold on there. I'm still not refueled yet.": "等等，我这边还没加完油呢。",
  "Hold on, I've got contacts inbound": "等下，我遇见敌机了",
