  "Hold on.": "稍等。",
  "Hold on. Be right with you.": "稍等，我马上来。",
  "Hold on. I think I shot too much.": "等下，我一下子射太多了。",
  "Hold on. Let me hook you up with the specifics.": "稍等，我把细节发送给你。",
  "Hold on. That son of a bitch skeeved out.": "等一下，那个傻逼东西溜走了。",
  "Hold please.": "等一会。",
  "Hold position": "保持原位",
  "Hold position as the ~mission(AmbushTarget) approaches.": "在 ~mission(AmbushTarget) 靠近时保持位置。",
  "Hold position until the next Patrol Area is determined.": "在确认下一个巡逻区域前，保持原位。",
  "Hold position.": "原地等待。",
  "Hold still damn it, or I'm gonna cut your- son of a bitch! Get me a clamp!": "别他妈乱动，不然信不信我切掉你的—真是操了！给我个钳子！",
  "Hold still!": "别动！",
  "Hold still, goddammit.": "别动，妈的。",
  "Hold still.": "保持静止。",
  "Hold the airlock!": "稳住气闸！",
  "Hold the door.": "把下门。",
  "Hold the zone, people.": "大家守住区域。",
  "Hold them the hell down, damn it!": "按住他们，妈的！",
  "Hold there. Beginning scan.": "停在那别动。正在开始扫描。",
  "Hold this ground.": "守住这里。",
  "Hold tight while I scan the sector.": "待命，我扫描下这片区域。",
  "Hold tight, I'll help out.": "坚持住，我来了。",
  "Hold tight. Targets should be inbound soon.": "小心，目标即将抵达。",
  "Hold tight. We're starting to transfer your cargo.": "请稍等。我们开始转移您的货物了。",
  "Hold until further support.": "等待支援到来。",
