  "Hold until scan is complete.": "扫描结束前原地待命。",
  "Hold up a sec. Gonna do a scan.": "等一下，扫描一下。",
  "Hold up a sec. Need to check something.": "等一下。需要检查点东西。",
  "Hold up for a second.": "稍等一下。",
  "Hold up, hold up, don't shoot.": "等等，等等，别开枪。",
