  "Holy crap, what was that?": "我去，那是啥？",
  "Holy crap, you see that? I took that ship out! That was me!": "哦草，你看到了吗？我干掉一个！是我干的！",
  "Holy hell!": "我去！",
  "Holy shit that was close.": "我操刚才实在太吓人了。",
  "Holy shit!": "卧槽！",
  "Holy shit! Are you one of them!": "见鬼，你跟他们是一伙儿的？！",
  "Holy shit! What the hell are you doing?": "卧槽！你干啥呢？",
  "Holy shit! Who the hell is that?!": "我靠！那他妈是谁？！",
  "Holy shit, am I glad to see you. Hope you're in the mood for a fight.": "天哪，见到你真高兴。希望你有兴致打一架。",
  "Holy shit, that was one of our ships.": "天哪，那是一艘我们的船。",
  "Holy shit, they just killed 'em.": "我操，他们刚杀了几个人。",
  "Holy shit. I think might have pulled this off.": "我操，我好像把这玩意儿拔下来了。",
  "Holy shit. You got tuned up.": "我的天，你抽太多了。",
  "Holy shit. You... you are a beast. Helluva job on that last run.": "我勒个去，你...你可真是猛兽，这次工作做的太棒了。",
  "Holy shit... I thought that was it. I thought I was done for.": "我操...我以为我完了。我以为我真的玩完了。",
  "Holy smokes. Please tell me you saw that epic multi-kill.": "我天，你一定也看到了那个多重击杀。",
