  "Homicide": "蓄意谋杀",
  "Hone your skills versus cutting-edge drone programs.": "磨练您对抗先进无人机的技能。",
  "Honestly, this isn't going to end well for you.": "说真的，这样下去你可不会有什么好结局。",
  "Honestly, work is not my favorite subject right now.": "实话说，工作可不是我现在想谈的话题。",
  "Honestly, you can't be here right now.": "说实话，你现在不该出现在这里。",
  "Honestly? The console's got more information than I do.": "说实话？这台终端知道的信息比我还多。",
  "Hoo Rah!": "万岁！",
  "Hoowee, there's a new boss in town.": "嚯嚯，这场比赛迎来了新的霸主。",
  "Hope all of your affairs are in order.": "你应该安排好后事了吧？",
  "Hope everything's been going all right out there.": "希望外面的一切都好。",
  "Hope that's the last I see of their sorry face.": "希望这是我最后一次看到他们的臭脸。",
  "Hope they're ready for this.": "希望他们已经准备好了。",
  "Hope to see you again one day.": "希望下次还能再见到你。",
  "Hope you enjoy your meal.": "希望你享受你的餐点。",
  "Hope you find something that suits you.": "希望你能找到适合自己的东西。",
  "Hope you got some more ammo. They're calling in backup.": "希望你还有弹药，他们呼叫了增援。",
  "Hope you're enjoying this.": "你打得挺开心是吧。",
  "Hope you're looking for a fight, cause you just found one.": "希望你是来打架的，因为你刚刚找到个对手。",
  "Hope you're paying attention. That was one of yours we just got.": "希望你有看到，刚刚那个被干掉的是你们的人。",
  "Hope you're ready to die, asshole.": "希望你已经准备好受死了，杂种。",
  "Hope you're ready, this one'll be tougher than your usual scumbag. Good luck.": "希望你准备好了，这次的家伙可比你平时对付的混蛋更难对付。祝你好运。",
  "Hope you're up for a scrap. This job's set to get nasty.": "希望你能准备好了。事情或许会变得很棘手。",
  "Hope your insurance is paid up.": "希望你的保险买够了。",
  "Hope your regen's better at fighting than you are.": "但愿你的再生能力比你的战斗能力更好。",
  "Hopefully I'll see you again soon.": "希望能很快再见到你。",
  "Hopefully there won't be any more distractions.": "希望不会有其他的了。",
  "Hopefully, I'll see you around.": "希望以后还能再见。",
  "Hopefully, this thing isn't already gone. Better hurry up and find out.": "希望这玩意儿还在那儿。你最好快点找出来。",
