  "How about giving me some space?": "能不能给我挪点空间？",
  "How about some backup?": "有人支援吗？",
  "How about some goddamn help? I'm almost done for.": "介意过来提供点儿该死的帮助吗？我都快完蛋了。",
  "How about some help here?": "能帮下我这里吗？",
  "How about some help over here!": "不介意来帮帮我吧！",
