  "How about some space?": "给我留点空间如何？",
  "How about some tea?": "来杯茶？",
  "How about that Jata lineup? Last night was one hell of a match.": "你觉得亚塔队的阵容怎么样？昨晚的比赛可真是太精彩了。",
  "How about that detailing? It's something else.": "细节如何？这是另一回事。",
  "How about the traffic today? Took me twice as long to get here.": "今天路况如何？我花了平时双倍的时间才到这。",
  "How about we all just forget this thing happened...": "要不我们就当无事发生……",
  "How about we check the next one?": "我们去看看下一个吧？",
  "How about we don't shoot our friends?": "咱能别射队友吗？",
