  "How about you finish what you have first, and then order more?": "不如您先喝完手上那杯，然后再点别的？",
  "How about you focus on keeping that ship alive?": "要不你把注意力集中在保护飞船上？",
  "How about you get off your ass and take a look.": "挪挪你的屁股，去检查一下。",
  "How about you give me some god damn room!": "能不能他妈的给我腾个地！",
  "How about you let me worry about my own damn schedule, all right?": "我的安排就让我自己考虑，好吗？",
