  "How many more of those you think you can take?": "你觉得自己还能抗下多少发？",
  "How many more of you I gotta kill before you get the point?": "我还得杀掉你们多少人，你们才能醒悟过来。",
  "How may I help you today?": "今天我能为您做些什么？",
  "How mortifying. Basic orientation is a skill every player requires.": "真是令人羞愧，基本定位是每个球员都需要掌握的技能。",
  "How much longer is this?": "还要看多久啊？",
