  "Jata JGCC is going to have to continue on with one less combatant.": "亚塔JGCC队将不得不在少了一名战斗人员的情况下继续下去。",
  "Jata ZGCC is down to one last combatant.": "亚塔ZGCC队只剩最后一人了。",
  "Jata _ Angeli really trying to hold the line.": "亚塔队_安吉利队正在尽力防守。",
  "Jata _ Angeli standing firm in the face of that press.": "亚塔队_安吉利队面对防守压力岿然不动。",
  "Jata falls as the Aeros clinch the round.": "亚塔队失利，航天队拿下一城。",
  "Jata ganks the ball mid-play. Nice steal.": "亚塔队的球在中场被抢断了，漂亮的抢球。",
  "Jata getting a little bit physical with the ball.": "亚塔队带球时有些身体接触。",
