  "Jata managed to overcome the Aeros this round.": "这一轮，亚塔队战胜了航天队。",
  "Jata moving the ball steadily across the field.": "亚塔队稳稳地把球传过了球场。",
  "Jata must be holding their breath. I smell a goal in the next play.": "亚塔队现在一定屏住了呼吸，我已经闻到下一次进球的味道了。",
  "Jata shuts it down with some solid defensive shooting!": "亚塔队用一记稳健的防守将球挡出！",
  "Jata takes it to the goal with style.": "亚塔队漂亮地将球送入球门。",
