  "Javelin": "标枪",
  "Javelin Tour": "参观标枪",
  "Javelin is already en route. Go on and get after them.": "标枪已经上路了，去追他们吧。",
  "Javelin is away. Join up at its location and lets put an end to this.": "标枪离开了，让我们去目标地点会合，结束这一切。",
  "Javelin just took a massive shot from that Idris.": "那标枪吃了一记狠的。",
  "Javelin just took one from the main gun.": "标枪刚刚被主炮打中一发。",
  "Javelin shield down. All ships. Defensive positions.": "标枪护盾下线。所有船只进入防御阵型！",
  "Javelin's almost fully resupplied. Navy said they only need a couple more drops.": "标枪马上补给完毕，海军说他们只需要再补充一小点就行了。",
  "Javelin's at capacity for that supply. No need for it anymore.": "标枪已满载该补给物资，不再需要了。",
  "Javelin's been taken out. Repeat, the Javelin's been taken out.": "标枪已被击毁！重复！标枪已被击毁！",
  "Javelin's been taking some heavy hits. Start protecting it.": "标枪遭受几次致命打击，开始掩护！",
  "Javelin's clear from the station and ready to engage XenoThreat.": "标枪已出港，准备与异种威胁交战。",
  "Javelin's disengaged from Jericho and might lend a hand with the stragglers.": "标枪已驶离杰里科港，路上会顺手帮一下那些掉队的。",
  "Javelin's filling up but there's still a way to go.": "标枪已开始装载，但还需要不少物资。",
  "Javelin's getting chewed up.": "标枪受损。",
  "Javelin's getting their Quantum online to get back out there.": "标枪正在重新启动量子驱动器准备重返战场。",
  "Javelin's heading in. This is about to get interesting.": "标枪正在路上。待会可有好戏看了。",
  "Javelin's here. Time to dish out some punishment.": "标枪来了，是时候给他们点教训了。",
  "Javelin's jumping in and ready to rock.": "标枪已入场，看样子它迫不及待要大干一场了。",
  "Javelin's lost a shield.": "标枪被打掉一个护盾。",
  "Javelin's on deck. XenoThreat's in for it now.": "标枪已准备完毕，这帮异种这下有好果子吃了。",
  "Javelin's on site and engaging targets.": "标枪已就位，瞄准目标。",
  "Javelin's on the move. They're taking too much fire.": "标枪正在撤离，他们遭受的火力太猛烈了！",
  "Javelin's spinning up to head back to the front.": "标枪正准备返回前线。",
  "Javelin's spinning up. I want everyone protecting them until they launch.": "标枪正在准备启航，我要所有人前去掩护，直到他们离开这为止。",
  "Javelin's taking a beating. Look out for them. Copy?": "标枪受到攻击，搜寻敌军，收到请回复。",
  "Javelin's taking fire.": "标枪正在遭受攻击。",
  "Javelin's taking some fire. Get those outlaws off 'em.": "标枪遭受攻击，把那些亡命之徒赶走。",
  "Jaw": "下巴",
  "Jean Hopwood, President": "让·霍普伍德，主席",
  "Jeez!": "靠！",
  "Jeez, fuck it. I'll find somebody else.": "天啊，他妈的，我去找别人了。",
  "Jeez, look at 'em run. Too bad you couldn't land that killshot.": "天哪，看他们跑的。可惜你没能打出致命一击。",
  "Jeez, never mind. I'll rob someone easier.": "天哪，别在意了。我会去挑点软柿子捏的。",
  "Jeez, our ammo counters really go.": "我靠，已经没弹药了",
  "Jeez, what time is it?": "天呐，现在几点了？",
