  "Keep 'em clear. I'm still working.": "把他们赶走，我快搞定了。",
  "Keep 'em off me for a sec.": "帮我拖住他们一会。",
  "Keep 'em off me!": "让他们离我远点！",
  "Keep 'em off me, okay? I'm not done.": "让他们滚开，ok？我需要更多时间。",
  "Keep 'em off me.": "把他们赶走。",
  "Keep 'em off me. I'm almost done.": "把他们赶走，我快搞定了。",
  "Keep 'em off me. We're still working.": "挡住他们，我们还有活儿要干。",
  "Keep Array Offline": "保持阵列离线",
  "Keep Shielded During Quantum Travel.": "在量子航行中需保持密闭",
  "Keep Xenothreat off that Javelin until it can quantum out of here.": "让异种威胁远离标枪，直到它能从这量子出去。",
  "Keep a lookout with this hazard-themed livery for your Aurora.": "当您的极光身着危险主题的外观时，请保持警惕。",
  "Keep an eye on the target. But keep quiet.": "盯紧目标，保持安静。",
  "Keep an eye on your scanner in case any trouble shows up.": "注意你的扫描器，以免有什么麻烦找上门。",
  "Keep an eye on your scans. There might be some unfriendly sorts out there.": "注意点儿你的雷达。那里可能有一些不友好的人。",
  "Keep an eye open though, you might run into some unfriendly types.": "警惕一点，你可能遇到一些不怎么友好的家伙。",
  "Keep an eye out for trouble.": "多留意周围的麻烦。",
  "Keep an eye out, I'm gonna see what the fuss is.": "注意盯着点，我去看看这是在搞什么幺蛾子。",
  "Keep an eye out.": "小心点。",
  "Keep an eye out. Word is the area's turning hostile.": "保持警惕。有消息说这里开始变得不安全。",
  "Keep an eye out. Word is, some hitters got an interest in this package as well.": "保持警惕。有消息说，一些打手也对这个包裹感兴趣。",
  "Keep at it. We're cutting down their numbers.": "坚持，他们的实力已经被我们大大削弱了！",
  "Keep bringing in crates so we can get this ship stocked.": "继续运送物资回来，这样才能让舰船完成装载。",
  "Keep close.": "保持靠近。",
  "Keep going, slick. I want this whole thing wrapped up soon.": "继续保持，滑头。我希望这事能尽快结了。",
  "Keep it close.": "保持靠近。",
  "Keep it cozy.": "呆在一起。",
  "Keep it going, people.": "大家别停，动起来。",
  "Keep it moving, folks.": "大家往前走，别停下。",
  "Keep it moving, people.": "继续前进，别停。",
  "Keep it moving.": "不要停下来。",
  "Keep it tight.": "保持靠近。",
  "Keep it to yourself.": "别告诉别人。",
  "Keep it together and don't get sloppy.": "振作起来，不要马虎。",
  "Keep it together, pal. People are gonna start talking.": "振作起来，伙计。别人会说你闲话的。",
  "Keep it together.": "团结起来。",
  "Keep it together...": "保持冷静……",
  "Keep it up!": "继续！",
  "Keep it up. Javelin's getting close to half full.": "继续，标枪就快装满一半了。",
  "Keep it up. We're almost there.": "继续。我们快到了。",
  "Keep looking.": "继续找。",
  "Keep looking. They're here someplace.": "继续找，他们就在这里。",
  "Keep moving.": "不要停。",
  "Keep on rolling, slick.": "继续搞啊，臭小子。",
  "Keep rolling.": "滚麻利点。",
  "Keep screwing around and I'm pulling the plug.": "再乱来我就得请你走了。",
  "Keep searching. They've got to be close.": "接着找。他们肯定在附近。",
  "Keep the Comm Arrays Offline": "保持通信阵列离线",
  "Keep the Nine Tails off the scanning ships, or they won't be able to finish!": "让九尾离扫描船远点，不然他们就要完蛋了！",
  "Keep the crates coming. Navy's saying the ship's over half capacity.": "继续把那些物资运来，海军说舰船的装载量已经过半了。",
  "Keep the fight warm. I'll be back.": "你们再坚持一会我还会回来的。",
  "Keep the fighters off me so I can work.": "拦住这些战机这样我才能干活。",
  "Keep the pressure on 'em.": "继续压制他们。",
  "Keep them back!": "别让他们过来！",
  "Keep them busy. I'm almost there.": "拖住他们，我就快好了。",
  "Keep them off me.": "别让他们靠近我。",
  "Keep this up and you're gonna regret it.": "你继续，我保证你会后悔。",
  "Keep to your own flight lane, okay?": "保持自己的飞行路线，好吗？",
  "Keep trying. You'll never take me.": "接着来啊，你永远都干部掉我的。",
  "Keep twisting. I'm on my way.": "继续纠缠。我在路上了。",
  "Keep up the effort. Safety of the sector is counting on us.": "继续努力，这片区域的安全仰仗着我们。",
  "Keep up the good work everyone. We should be done scanning the area soon.": "各位再接再厉，我们很快就能完成本区域的扫描了。",
  "Keep up the good work, Marine.": "继续努力，海军陆战队们。",
  "Keep up the good work. Javelin's almost resupplied.": "继续你们的出色工作，标枪的补给工作就要完成了。",
  "Keep up the pressure.": "保持压制。",
