  "Let me know if I can help.": "有需要我帮忙的尽管说。",
  "Let me know if we attract any unwanted attention, okay?": "要是有闲杂人等搞事，通知我，OK？",
  "Let me know if you change your mind.": "改变主意了就告诉我。",
  "Let me know if you have any questions.": "如果您有任何问题，请告诉我。",
  "Let me know if you have second thoughts.": "如果你改变注意的话，请告诉我。",
