  "Let me send you a few tidbits and facts about microTech.": "我向您发送了一些微科的趣闻。",
  "Let me send you your hangar assignment.": "让我帮你把机库位给安排上。",
  "Let me tell you, the client sure as hell isn't gonna be happy about this.": "我告诉你，客户对这事儿绝对不会高兴的。",
  "Let me think...": "让我看看...",
  "Let's Meet": "让我们来见面",
  "Let's be reasonable about this.": "我们还是讲讲道理吧。",
  "Let's bring you in.": "让我带你进来吧。",
  "Let's calm down. I won't tell you again.": "我们都冷静点，我不会再说第二遍了。",
  "Let's check it out.": "我们去检查一下。",
  "Let's dance.": "让我们跳舞吧。",
  "Let's do a sweep through the sector. Head to each marker and ping your scanner.": "我们在这片区域执行一次扫查吧。前往标记区域，执行回波探测。",
  "Let's do this again sometime.": "我们下次再一起并肩作战吧。",
  "Let's do this.": "开干吧。",
  "Let's fall back.": "我们撤退。",
  "Let's fan out.": "扇形展开。",
