  "Let's get you some food, okay?": "来点吃的怎么样？",
  "Let's go ahead and call that last job done.": "我们做最后一件事吧。",
  "Let's go ahead and check the hangars...": "让我看看机库的状态...",
  "Let's go for a ride.": "让我们动起来吧。",
  "Let's go people! I need those scans now!": "快啊！我现在就要扫描结果！",
  "Let's go to the next stop.": "让我们去下一站吧。",
  "Let's go to work.": "我们干活去。",
  "Let's go!": "我们走！",
  "Let's go! Let's go!": "我们走！我们走！",
  "Let's go, folks.": "出发吧，伙计们。",
