  "May day, may day, may day may argh!": "求救，求救，求救，求呃啊！！",
  "May day, may day, may day may...argh!!": "求救，求救，求救，求... 呃啊！！",
  "May day? May day, may day may day, anyone there, hey, anyone... argh!": "求救？求救，求救，求救，有人吗，嘿，有人...呃啊！",
  "May our Thul recognize and honor us.": "愿我们的Thul认可并以我们为荣。",
  "Maybe I should start flying one-handed, make things more fair.": "或许我应该单手飞，这样对你公平点。",
  "Maybe I should try something new today?": "也许我今天该试试新菜？",
  "Maybe I'm going crazy.": "也许是我疯了。",
  "Maybe do a hard reset before it saves.": "也许在保存之前还是来一个硬重置吧。",
  "Maybe finish those drinks first and then see if you're up for more.": "您先喝完那些，看看还喝得下别的吗。",
  "Maybe got something. Kicking off a patrol to look into it.": "可能有人，正在派遣巡逻队前往调查。",
  "Maybe if you actually got off your ass and helped.": "也许你该起身帮帮忙了。",
  "Maybe just a snack...": "我就吃个点心...",
  "Maybe knock out round one before coming back for round two?": "不如吃完一轮再加。",
  "Maybe later then.": "那就晚点吧。",
  "Maybe my callsign should be Bullet Sponge.": "也许我总是容易被集火呢。",
  "Maybe next time, huh?": "也许下次吧，嗯？",
  "Maybe next time.": "也许下次吧。",
  "Maybe serving a stretch will help you get your head back on straight.": "也许揍你一顿才能让你脑袋清醒。",
  "Maybe start avoiding the incoming fire? Just an idea.": "可能要开始避开来袭的攻击了？仅仅是一个想法。",
  "Maybe we should spread out.": "也许我们应该散开来。",
  "Maybe you can go help? Sending location now.": "也许你可以去帮忙？现在发送位置。",
  "Maybe you should go check it out.": "也许你得去看看。",
  "Maybe you wanna slow down a bit? Enjoy that first and then order more.": "也许您想慢一点？先享受一下，然后再点更多。",
  "Maybe you're looking for something with a bit more blast than just a cocktail.": "也许...你在找些比鸡尾酒更猛烈些的玩意？",
  "Maybe?": "或许？",
  "Mayday!": "求救！",
  "Mayday! Emergency assistance desperately needed. Send help.": "求救！极度需要紧急支援，派支援来。",
