  "Nice bounce off the electric field.": "电场反弹得不错。",
  "Nice choice.": "不错的选择。",
  "Nice doing business with you.": "很高兴与您共事。",
  "Nice first delivery. Now get back out there.": "第一趟送的很不错，再回去继续把货带来吧。",
  "Nice flying.": "干的漂亮。",
  "Nice going, sir": "干得漂亮，长官",
  "Nice job keeping them alive.": "你让他们活下来了，干得漂亮。",
  "Nice job on that last one.": "这回干的不错。",
  "Nice job taking out that Polaris before it could run again.": "干得好，我们在北极星再次逃跑之前就把它干掉了。",
  "Nice job taking out that quantum dampener. Keep it up.": "干得好，你击毁了一艘量子抑阻船。继续努力。",
  "Nice job taking that out.": "干得漂亮。",
  "Nice job taking them out. I'll push your payment through.": "把他们解决了真是干得漂亮。我会把你的报酬转过去。",
  "Nice job, all. The Navy has been fully resupplied and send their thanks.": "做得不错，各位。海军已经补给完毕，向您表示感谢。",
  "Nice job.": "表现不错。",
  "Nice kill": "干净利落",
  "Nice kill, sunshine": "漂亮，老兄",
  "Nice killing": "杀得漂亮",
  "Nice move, sir": "干得漂亮，长官",
  "Nice of you to drop in.": "你能来可太好了。",
  "Nice of you to finally join us.": "很高兴你终于加入我们了。",
  "Nice one mate.": "干得好伙计。",
  "Nice one!": "漂亮！",
  "Nice one.": "漂亮。",
  "Nice one. Get the core back": "干得漂亮.把核心取夺回来了",
  "Nice one. Still got a few causing problems and then we should be good.": "干得好。还有一些要解决，然后我们就完事了。",
  "Nice pass.": "好一个传球。",
  "Nice right? Can't remember where that came from.": "很不错，对吧。不过我忘记这东西是哪来的了。",
  "Nice seeing you.": "很高兴见到你。",
  "Nice ship. Very shiny.": "很好的船。非常闪亮。",
  "Nice shooting": "一发入魂",
  "Nice shooting, sir": "射得漂亮，长官",
  "Nice shooting.": "打的漂亮。",
  "Nice shot, pilot.": "打得好，飞行员。",
  "Nice shot.": "好球。",
  "Nice snag, sir, get the core back": "好样的，伙计，把核心带回去",
  "Nice talking with you.": "谈话很愉快。",
  "Nice to have you back. Now get to work and make your shots count.": "很高兴你能回来，准备上工，让自己发挥点作用。",
  "Nice to meet you.": "很高兴遇见你。",
  "Nice to see a familiar face around.": "很高兴看到一个熟悉的面孔在身边。",
  "Nice to see ya.": "见到你真好。",
  "Nice to see you again.": "很高兴再次见到您。",
  "Nice to see you again. Let's get docked and refueled.": "很高兴又见到你。咱们对接，把油加上吧。",
  "Nice toss.": "扔得好。",
  "Nice try, dumb ass.": "想得挺好，蠢蛋。",
  "Nice try.": "不错的尝试。",
  "Nice work on the last job, by the way.": "顺便一提，上次的活儿干得真棒。",
  "Nice work taking out that Vanduul.": "干得漂亮，干掉了那个剜度。",
  "Nice work.": "干得好。",
  "Nice work. Just come on back and sweep up these stragglers.": "干得好。回来把那些残兵败将都给打扫干净吧。",
  "Nice!": "漂亮！",
  "Nice, that ship would've been a problem if it got away.": "太好了，如果那艘飞船离开了，会造成很多问题的。",
  "Nice, yes? I make it.": "很不错，是吧？我做的。",
  "Nice, you're clear of the pad.": "很好，停机坪已经清空了。",
  "Nice.": "奈斯。",
  "Nice. Coming up.": "很好。马上来。",
  "Nice. Glad things are going pretty good for you.": "好啊，真高兴你日子过得不错。",
  "Nice. I'll get that slice for you.": "很好，我给您拿一片。",
  "Nice. Look at that. Got a hangar free that's perfect for ya.": "棒极了，看，有个正和你意的空机库正等着你。",
  "Nice. We scored": "漂亮。我们得分了",
  "Nice. You got the target.": "干得漂亮。你解决掉目标了。",
  "Nicely done.": "完美。",
