  "Nicely done. Have I said how happy I am you're here?": "干得好，我说过我很高兴你在这里吗？",
  "Nicely done. That was expertly handled.": "干的漂亮。处理的非常专业。",
  "Nicely done. They were tough, but you were tougher.": "干得漂亮。他们很强，但你更强。",
  "Nicely done. We can take care of your vehicle from here.": "干得好，接下来我们会妥善处理你的载具。",
