  "Not many people could it pull that off, but for you, it works.": "没几个人配得上这个，但是您配。",
  "Not many people could it pull that off, but you, it works.": "没几个人配得上这玩意儿，但您，可太般配了。",
  "Not much to talk about here.": "这地方没什么好说的。",
  "Not much track left. Time to make your move.": "赛道快跑完了，加把劲，快。",
