  "Not on my watch, says Angeli.": "安吉利队可不会让这种事情发生在自己眼皮底下。",
  "Not on my watch, says Jata.": "安吉利队可不会让这种事情发生在自己眼皮底下。",
  "Not picking up any hostile activity. Giving you the all clear.": "未发现任何敌对活动。一切正常。",
  "Not quite sure what you did, but it must have been pretty bad if they sent me.": "虽然不知道你做了什么，但是他们让我来肯定是非常坏的事情。",
  "Not really": "倒不见得",
  "Not really a lot going on upstairs, huh?": "楼上应该没什么事儿，哈？",
  "Not really in the mood to talk about work.": "并没有什么心情讨论工作的事儿。",
  "Not really the best time to bail on a job.": "现在可不是丢下工作的最佳时机啊。",
  "Not really.": "不见得。",
  "Not right now. I'll see if I can scare something up for you later.": "现在没有活儿。以后看看能不能给你找点事做。",
  "Not seeing 'em on my radar.": "我的雷达上看不到他们。",
  "Not seeing any more Nine Tails in the area. Think we?re good for now.": "没看到再有九尾出现在这附近，我想我们暂时安全了。",
  "Not seeing any more hostiles. That was impressive.": "我没有看见其他更多敌人了。太惊人了。",
  "Not seeing anything on the scans. Think you're good.": "扫描上什么都没看到。我认为你干的很好。",
  "Not seeing anything.": "什么都没找到。",
  "Not seeing anything. It was probably nothing.": "我什么都没看到，也许这里什么都没有。",
  "Not such an easy target, am I?": "我不是个好下手的目标，对吧?",
  "Not sure I get your motivation here, but sure, let's fight.": "我不太清楚你的动机是什么，不过好啊，来开打吧。",
  "Not sure about that.": "这我不太确定。",
  "Not sure exactly what's going on, but I'm gonna investigate.": "不知道到底是什么情况，但我会调查的。",
  "Not sure if the ship's gonna have escorts or not, so be ready for anything.": "不清楚目标船是否有护航，做好万全准备。",
  "Not sure if you heard, but the shift got extended.": "你知道吗，这班次延长了。",
  "Not sure if you just missed the signs, but you're heading the wrong way.": "不知道你是没看清楚路标还是什么，但你飞错方向了。",
  "Not sure if you've noticed, but there's a really strong smell over there.": "不知道你有没有注意到，那边有股特别刺鼻的气味。",
  "Not sure what \"race enhancers\" you're on, but you're flying the wrong direction.": "不知道你是磕上了哪种“竞赛增强剂”，但是你飞错方向了。",
  "Not sure what you're playing at, but I need you on site ASAP.": "我不知道你在玩什么，我需要你快点到场。",
  "Not sure what's going on with you, but it's too late now.": "不知道你到底想干啥，但是为时已晚。",
  "Not sure where they went, but they couldn't have gone far.": "不知道他们去哪了，但是应该跑不远。",
  "Not sure which one of these I should get?": "你说我应该选哪一个呢？",
  "Not sure why you're expecting me to pay Terra prices when we're not in Terra.": "不明白你为何期待我在泰拉以外的地方支付泰拉的价格。",
  "Not sure.": "不知道。",
  "Not technically a bob, but definitely a nice look.": "不完全是波波头，但绝对是个不错的发型。",
  "Not the time to lose faith.": "还没到放弃的时候。",
  "Not the time, chief.": "现在不是时候，老兄。",
  "Not the time.": "现在不是时候。",
  "Not the worst place in Pyro.": "不是派罗里最糟糕的敌方。",
  "Not this time, asshole.": "这次没中，混蛋。",
  "Not this time. No problem.": "这次不接，没问题。",
  "Not to be all 'authority figure' on you, but you got to move your ship now.": "我并不是想用什么“权威人士”的角度跟你说话，但是你得挪一挪你的船。",
  "Not to brag, but I killed the crap out of that ship.": "不是我吹，我把那坨垃圾射穿了。",
  "Not to rush you or anything, but this needs to get taken care of fast.": "不是催你或者别的，但这件事很急。",
