  "Now that I'm clear I can strafe forward onto the taxiway.": "现在我确定可以向前平移至滑道。",
  "Now that you got that code, you can head over to engineering for the next one.": "既然你已经拿到了代码，可以去工程翼拿下一段了。",
  "Now that you're here, I'm marking a spot that should keep your sig quiet.": "既然你到了，我正在标记一个能抑制你信号特征的地方。",
  "Now that you're in position, we can start the lesson. Standby.": "现在你已就位，我们可以开始上课了，预备。",
  "Now that's what I call a bang up job.": "这就是我说的临时工作。",
  "Now you gotta deal with Scorch. You all right with that, Scorch?": "现在你得对付斯考奇了。你能搞定他们吧，斯考奇?",
  "Now you see why Nine Tails are feared across the 'verse.": "现在你知道为什么全宇宙都怕九尾了吧。",
  "Now you want to listen? Fine...": "又想听了？行吧...",
  "Now you want to listen? Okay, where was I?": "现在你想听了？行吧，我之前说到哪来着？",
  "Now you want to run?!": "现在你想溜了？！",
  "Now you're done for sure.": "现在你铁定完蛋了。",
  "Now your weapons are online.": "现在，您的武器已上线。",
  "Now's the time for any last words.": "有什么遗言就现在说吧。",
  "Now, let's go ahead and see what new jobs we have available for you.": "现在，让我们看看有什么为您准备的新工作吧。",
  "Now, let's go ahead see what new jobs we have available for you.": "现在，让我们看看有什么为您准备的新工作吧。",
  "Now, we just have to do a bunch of work.": "我们现在有一票活儿要干。",
  "Now, what I'm hoping is that sometimes that someone I find is going to be you.": "现在，我希望以后你就是我可以找的那个人。",
  "Now, where was I...": "我刚刚说到哪了来着...",
  "Nowhere get's you rollin' like Wheeler's.": "请像轮子一样圆润地离开。",
  "Nowhere to go but down.": "无处可走，只能一直往下。",
