  "Of all the people I've hunted, you're barely cracking the top fifty.": "在所有我追捕过的人里，你可能都排不到前50。",
  "Of course, doctor.": "好的，医生。",
  "Of course, you will have to return any property that rightfully belongs to me.": "当然，你还是得把属于我的东西还来。",
  "Of course.": "当然。",
  "Of course. Like thing's weren't bad enough.": "一定要来是吧，仿佛事情还不够糟似的。",
  "Of course. Please check with the terminal.": "当然可以，请在终端机上确认一下。",
  "Ofc.": "警卫",
  "Off": "关",
  "Off limits.": "你越界了。",
  "Off to the races?": "去参加比赛？",
