  "Officer on deck!": "长官莅临！",
  "Offline": "离线",
  "Offline for Maintenance": "离线维护中",
  "Offsite Only": "仅限场外",
  "Oh (laughs), so that's how it's gonna be.": "噢（笑），原来是想干架啊。",
  "Oh Booo!": "哦吼~！",
  "Oh I don't know. Maybe a little Neon?": "要不来点霓虹？",
  "Oh I dropped it! I dropped it! Ohhh I dropped it": "好了，我停下，我不动！啊啊，我停了。",
  "Oh I've been there. Let me get the next round. Help cheer you up.": "深有体会，我去拿下一杯，希望能让你振作起来。",
  "Oh Now you want to listen? Okay, where was I?": "现在你想听了？行吧，我之前说到哪来着？",
  "Oh Ship": "噢，船",
  "Oh Where you going? We were just gonna have some fun.": "哦，你要去哪里？我们只是想找点乐子。",
  "Oh check out! That's crazy.": "快看！太疯狂了。",
  "Oh come on, really?!": "噢，拜托，认真的吗？！",
  "Oh come on.": "噢，又来。",
  "Oh come on. How many of them are there?": "我靠，他们到底有多少人？",
  "Oh come on. Not even a peek inside?": "啊拜托，看都不看一眼吗？",
  "Oh come on. Shoot them, not me!": "老天啊。去打他们，别打我。",
  "Oh come, no. Ahh.": "哦别这样，别啊。",
  "Oh damn!": "噢，操！",
  "Oh damn, sweet.": "哇哦，真好看。",
  "Oh damn, that looked painful.": "我靠，那看起来会很痛苦。",
  "Oh damn, this poor bastard's dead!": "哦操，这可怜的傻逼死了！",
  "Oh damn, you crazy.": "哦，妈的，你疯了。",
  "Oh damn... they got a Titan.": "妈的……他们有泰坦。",
  "Oh god, I don't wanna die.": "天呐，我不想死。",
  "Oh god, help!": "老天啊，救命！",
  "Oh god, no. Please.": "天呐，求你不要啊。",
  "Oh god, oh god, help me please.": "哦上帝啊，真主啊，快帮我。",
  "Oh god.": "哦天哪！",
  "Oh god. I didn't think anyone was coming. Hurry and help me take them out.": "天呐，没想到真有人会来。快来帮我把他们干掉。",
  "Oh god. Oh god. Oh god.": "我的天，我的天，我的天。",
  "Oh god? what the hell is that?": "哦我的天，那他妈什么鬼？",
  "Oh hell no. Get out of here.": "不可以，你走吧。",
  "Oh hell no. I'm out of here.": "想都别想。我撤了。",
  "Oh hell with this.": "去他的吧。",
  "Oh hell yeah. Just got a couple more to deal with and we should be good.": "噢，太他妈对了。再解决几个，我们就完事了。",
  "Oh hello!": "啊，你好！",
  "Oh hello, who's out there?": "噢，你好啊，谁在那？",
  "Oh hello...": "你好啊...",
  "Oh here we go, come on.": "哦，开始吧，来吧。",
  "Oh hey there. You look like someone I want to shoot.": "你好啊，你长得有点像我的靶子。",
  "Oh hey! Everything's good. Not much to report.": "你好啊！一切正常，没有什么要汇报的。",
  "Oh hey, good to see you again.": "哦嘿，很高兴再见到您。",
  "Oh hey.": "哦嗨。",
  "Oh jeez. Got a contact that looks like they're in trouble.": "哦，天呐。有个不明目标看起来有麻烦了。",
  "Oh joy, look who it is.": "哦吼，看看是“谁”来了。",
  "Oh my bad! Didn't mean to hit you.": "噢，我的错！我不是故意打你的。",
  "Oh my god!": "老天啊！",
  "Oh my god, help me, please.": "哦天哪，快来帮帮我。",
  "Oh my god, that was beautiful. Unnerving, but beautiful.": "我的老天，这可太漂亮了。有点悬，但很漂亮。",
  "Oh my god.": "我的上帝啊。",
  "Oh my god. Help!": "我的天，救命啊！",
  "Oh my god. I thought I was done for. These outlaws just attacked. I need help.": "老天啊，我以为我死定了。这些歹徒在袭击我，我需要帮助。",
  "Oh nice. I've heard about these. They're supposed to be pretty good.": "哦不错，我听说过这些东西，据说挺好的。",
  "Oh no": "哦不",
  "Oh no (laughing)... that had to hurt.": "噢不（笑）...那肯定很疼吧。",
  "Oh no way": "哦不会吧",
  "Oh no!": "哦不！",
  "Oh no! Where did your shields go?": "哎呀不好了！你的护盾呢？",
  "Oh no, get ready. There's company coming your way.": "哦不，准备好。他们小队正在朝你那去。",
  "Oh no. Are they here to save everybody? (laugh) Good luck with that.": "哦，不。他们是来拯救所有人的吗？（笑）祝他们好运。",
  "Oh no. Here comes trouble.": "哦不，有麻烦了。",
  "Oh no. Look's like we got a trouble maker over here.": "不好，我们这儿来了个搞事的。",
  "Oh no. Looks like they called in some friends. That can't be good for us.": "糟糕，看起来他们叫了点朋友来。这对我们来说可不是什么好事。",
  "Oh no. You're not going anywhere.": "哦不，你哪儿也别想去。",
  "Oh please, please, please, please, please, please, please, please, please, argh!": "哦求求了，求求了，求求了，求求了，求求了，求求了，求求了，求求了，求求了，呃啊！",
  "Oh really?": "哦是吗？",
  "Oh shit!": "哦操！",
  "Oh shit! I'm hit!": "哦操！我被打中了！",
  "Oh shit! Lost one!": "哦操！有人死了！",
  "Oh shit! Security!": "糟了！警卫！",
  "Oh shit, I'm so sorry.": "哦靠，真不好意思。",
  "Oh shit, careful.": "我靠，小心！",
  "Oh shit, grenade!": "哦操，手雷！",
  "Oh shit, man down!": "哦操，有人倒了！",
  "Oh shit, right here!": "哦操，这里！",
  "Oh shit, shit, man down!": "哦，妈的，妈的，有人倒下了！",
  "Oh shit, that was amazing.": "我靠，刚才太猛了。",
  "Oh shit, that was one of ours.": "哦草，那是我们的人。",
  "Oh shit, they're right here!": "哦操，他们在这！",
  "Oh shit, we got a bleeder!": "干！他大出血了！",
  "Oh shit. Got a big one heading your way.": "哦操，有个大家伙朝你那去了。",
  "Oh shit. I probably needed that.": "糟了，我可能还是需要护航。",
  "Oh shit. There's, um, some ships coming in really fast.": "卧槽，有，有好多船朝我们来了，速度很快。",
  "Oh shit. Yeah, nice one.": "哦操，对，好选择。",
  "Oh shit... XenoThreat blew up an Idris.": "我操…异种威胁刚摧毁了一艘伊德里斯。",
  "Oh shit… someone's getting tuned up. Better get in there.": "我靠……有人在被修理。你最好快进去。",
  "Oh sure, hold on a sec, I got a job right here...": "哦当然，稍等一下，我这就有一个活儿...",
  "Oh sure, you're crazy rich and don't need the work.": "哦好吧，你是那种不用工作的大土豪。",
  "Oh thank god. Help me against these lawless reprobates. Please.": "谢天谢地。请帮我干掉这些无法无天的贱货。",
