  "Oh, you can call your ship on the terminal over there.": "哦，你可以用那边的终端呼叫你的船。",
  "Oh, you know, how about you?": "哦你知道的，你怎么样呢？",
  "Oh, you think you can just walk away now? I don't think so.": "哦，你觉得你可以就这么溜了？我可不这么认为。",
  "Oh, you wanna fight? You got one now.": "你是想打架吗？现在就来打一场。",
  "Oh, you want a fight? Well, shit...": "哦，你想打一架？好吧，操...",
  "Oh, you want it? Cool. I'll have it sent over.": "哦，你要这个？行，我叫人给你送过去。",
  "Oh, you want some too?": "哦，你也想参一脚？",
  "Oh, you want to play?": "噢，你想玩玩是吗？",
  "Oh, you're back.": "噢，你回来了。",
  "Oh, you're going to pay for that scag.": "哦，你会为你的愚蠢付出代价。",
  "Oh, you're going to pay for that.": "你会为此付出代价的。",
  "Oh, you're going to regret killing them.": "哦，杀掉他们你可要后悔的。",
  "Oh, you're gonna regret doing that.": "你会后悔这么做的。",
  "Oh, you're leaving… yeah, sure, that's fine. I can wait.": "哦，你要走啊……嗯，好吧，没关系。我可以等。",
