  "Oh... hey...": "哦...嗨！",
  "Oh... hey?": "哦...嗨?",
  "Oh... looks like your credits are running a little short, my friend.": "哦……看起来您手头有点紧，我的朋友。",
  "Oh... okay. That's great.": "哦，好吧，你开心就好。",
  "Oh... that was me.": "噢...我的错。",
  "Oh... yeah... you need a second. Sure.": "噢...好的...看来您需要点时间考虑下。没问题。",
