  "Okay. One 50/50.": "好的，一杯法式烘焙咖啡。",
  "Okay. Our destination's coming up.": "好，到达目的地了。",
  "Okay. Paging Dr. Ari Ealing to the lab. Not Dr. Beverly Ealing.": "等下，传呼阿利・伊林医生至实验室，不是贝弗莉・伊林医生。",
  "Okay. Thanks. You're clear to proceed.": "好的。感谢配合。你可以走了。",
  "Okay. That was a little closer than I would've liked.": "好吧，比我想的还要危险一点。",
  "Okay. That's not good.": "行吧，这可不是什么好事。",
  "Okay. That's one done. Who's next?": "好，干掉一个，谁是下一个？",
  "Okay. That's settled. You can go, but watch yourself.": "好的，这样就没事了。你可以走了，但请你洁身自好。",
  "Okay. Time to start scanning.": "好，是时候开始扫描了。",
  "Okay. We're Oscar Mike to the next scan point.": "好的，我们移动到下一个扫描点。",
  "Okay. We're getting close.": "好的，我们快到了。",
  "Okay. We're here.": "好，我们到了。",
  "Okay. We’re docked. Just set the transaction price to what was agreed.": "好，我们已经对接了。把交易价格设成说好的就行。",
  "Okay. Will make excellent vehicle for you. Yes. Move very well. You like.": "好的。会给你做惊人的载具。是的。移动起来很棒。你喜欢的。",
  "Okay. You let me know if you change your mind.": "好的，你要是改主意了就告诉我一声。",
  "Okay. You need parking. Let's have a look.": "好的好的，我知道你需要停船。让我们看看...",
  "Okay... looks like we got some assholes crashing our race.": "好的……看起来有些混蛋闯进了我们的比赛。",
  "Okay... looks pretty good... Yeah, I don't see anyone.": "好的... 看起来挺不错的。嗯，好像没什么人。",
  "Okay... looks pretty- Contact! Contact! Hostiles inbound.": "好的... 看来—— 接敌！接敌！ 敌军接近。",
  "Okay?": "好吧？",
  "Okay? moving on.": "行吧？就当无事发生。",
  "Okay? that's? something.": "嗯？这，还有点意思。",
  "Okay… Guess I'm supposed to just wait here then?": "好吧……看来我只能在这儿干等着了？",
