  "One of kind wares. If you can't find it here, you can't find it anywhere.": "开门儿好货，就我这儿卖，出了这门儿可就没了。",
  "One of our Hammerheads got ghosted.": "我们的一艘锤头鲨刚刚离我们而去了。",
  "One of our racers just up and quit... That's a bit dissapointing.": "一名选手刚刚弃权离开了……有些令人失望。",
  "One of ours got taken out.": "我们的一个友方被干掉了。",
  "One of ours just got cut down.": "我们有个人被干掉了。",
  "One of the Javelin's shields just went down.": "标枪的一个护盾下线了。",
  "One of the big boys of hauling, you can't really go wrong with the Starfarer.": "运输业的老大哥之一，选择星际远航者绝对没错。",
  "One of the contractors didn't work out so the rest of the patrol is just us.": "其中一个承包商没有不干了，所以剩下的巡逻队就只有我们了。",
