  "Shit for sale. Got shit for sale.": "这里什么都卖，什么都卖哦。",
  "Shit the bed.": "把我屎都吓出来了...",
  "Shit was crazy. I almost don't want to know.": "这可太疯了。想都不敢想。",
  "Shit was crazy. Saw two of them out there in the last second.": "太疯狂了，我最后看见了两只！",
  "Shit!": "操！",
  "Shit! Friendly down!": "操！友军倒下了！",
  "Shit! Help!": "妈的！救命！",
  "Shit! I gotta bail.": "妈的！我得跳了。",
  "Shit! My shields! Someone help!": "淦！我的盾！救！",
  "Shit! Rocket launcher!": "妈的！火箭筒！",
  "Shit! Sniper!": "操！狙击手！",
  "Shit! That really hurt.": "我靠，那下真狠。",
  "Shit! That was a stupid shot. Sorry.": "我去！这枪打得太烂了。对不起。",
  "Shit! Those shots are close.": "草！差点打到我。",
  "Shit! We're under attack!": "操！我们正在遭受攻击！",
  "Shit's about to get real now.": "现在要面对现实了。",
  "Shit, I swear they were right here.": "操，我发誓他们刚刚在这。",
  "Shit, I'm boxed in!": "操，我被困住了！",
  "Shit, I'm out!": "操，我没子弹了！",
  "Shit, I'm running low too.": "操，我也没啥子弹了。",
  "Shit, I'm taking damage.": "干，我被攻击了。",
  "Shit, behind!": "操，后面！",
  "Shit, can't find any trace of 'em.": "操，一点他们的痕迹都找不到。",
  "Shit, contact!": "操，敌方接触！",
  "Shit, going magma.": "操，过热了。",
  "Shit, grenade!": "操，手雷！",
  "Shit, missed.": "操，没打中。",
  "Shit, pilot down": "干，他被击落了",
  "Shit, rocket launcher! Get down!": "操，火箭筒！趴下！",
  "Shit, shit, shit <death scream>": "操，操，操 <死亡惨叫>",
  "Shit, shit, shit!": "操，操，操！",
  "Shit, shit, shit.": "操，操，操。",
  "Shit, sorry. We get weirdos wandering down here looking for handouts.": "妈的，抱歉。有一些怪人来这里寻找救济品。",
  "Shit, that hurt!": "操，痛！",
  "Shit, that hurts.": "靠，挺疼。",
  "Shit, that was close.": "操，就差一点。",
  "Shit, that's not good.": "妈的，这可不是什么好事。",
  "Shit, they called for back up.": "妈的，他们呼叫后援了。",
  "Shit, they called in some buddies.": "操，他们叫了几个人过来。",
  "Shit, they called in some more.": "该死，他们叫增援了。",
  "Shit, they got a Titan!": "操, 他们有架泰坦!",
  "Shit, they got away! Thought we had 'em this time.": "操，他们逃走了！我们以为这次我们抓住他们了。",
  "Shit, they just killed 'em.": "操，他们被杀了。",
  "Shit, they're gone!": "操，他们跑了！",
  "Shit, they're pushing in!": "操，他们在推进！",
  "Shit, they're right here!": "操，他们在这！",
  "Shit, titan suit!": "操，泰坦！",
  "Shit, we lost one of our own.": "妈的，我们失去了一艘友舰。",
  "Shit, we're being overrun!": "操，我们得跑了！",
  "Shit, we're dead in the water.": "操，我们死定了",
  "Shit, we're down one.": "操，我们倒下了一个人。",
  "Shit, we've been grabbed.": "靠！我们被抓住了！",
  "Shit, where did they go?": "操，他们去哪了?",
  "Shit, wherever they are, they won't get away long.": "操，不管他们在哪，都跑不远了。",
  "Shit, you okay?": "靠，你还好吗？",
  "Shit, you see that?": "操，你看见了吗？",
  "Shit.": "该死。",
  "Shit. Can't find 'em anymore.": "草，哪都找不到他们。",
  "Shit. Get that ship back in the restricted area before that timer counts down.": "该死的。在计时器结束之前，把那艘船开回限制区域。",
  "Shit. I can't shake it.": "我靠，我甩不掉了。",
  "Shit. Over here!": "妈的！在这里！",
  "Shit. Overheating!": "操。过热了！",
  "Shit. Shit!": "妈的，妈的！",
  "Shit. Sorry. It won't happen again.": "有病吧。对不起。这种事情不会再发生了。",
  "Shit. That Nine Tails hack completed. God knows what they just got away with.": "妈的。那个九尾的黑客成功了。天知道他们刚刚拿走了什么。",
  "Shit. We lost one.": "干，我们有人被击毁了。",
  "Shit...": "操了……",
  "Shit... all right, look, it's a no-go on backup. You're your own for this one.": "妈的... 好吧，听着，我们没有预备的援军。这事你只能靠自己了。",
  "Shit... that hurt.": "操...好痛。",
  "Shit? could this day get any worse.": "干？今天不能再糟心了。",
