  "So about that favor you're doing for me. There's been a complication.": "关于你帮我的那个忙，这里有点额外要求给你。",
  "So anyway, what's going on with you?": "算了，你怎么样了？",
  "So close.": "好险。",
  "So doctor, how does it look?": "所以，情况怎么样，医生？",
  "So far, haven't had too much trouble.": "还没碰上麻烦，暂时。",
  "So good to see you.": "很高兴见到你。",
  "So have the results come in, doctor?": "所以有结果了吗，大夫？",
  "So here's where you need to defend me.": "这里需要你保护我。",
  "So how you been? You good?": "所以你怎么样了？还行吗？",
  "So is this the one? I think it might be the one.": "所以您选这艘是吗？我就猜您会选这艘呢。",
  "So long you criminal piece of shit!": "走好你个垃圾罪犯！",
  "So many failed contracts....": "全是失败的合约....",
  "So many goals without a substantial response from the opposition.": "进了这么多球，对方却没能做出任何实质性的反击。",
  "So that thing? Yeah, it wasn't a problem.": "那个？啊对，不是什么大问题。",
  "So uh... I need some ammo.": "所以，呃……我需要子弹。",
  "So uh... maybe we can work something out?": "所以，呃……也许我们可以谈判下？",
  "So uhm... maybe we can work something out?": "所以嗯……也许我们能把事解决了？",
  "So what am I supposed to do? It's not like I can just come back.": "所以你指望我怎么做？你以为我还能就这么回去吗？",
  "So what do you think? We got a deal or what?": "您怎么看？我们达成协议了吗？",
  "So what you thinking?": "所以您在想什么？",
  "So what's it gonna be?": "所以，你怎么打算？",
  "So what's the deal?": "到底是怎么回事？",
  "So what's up, you in?": "怎么样，你加入吗？",
  "So what's up, you wanna do this?": "所以，要安排吗？",
  "So what's up?": "所以，怎么样了？",
  "So what's up? You need to eat?": "怎么说？您需要吃点东西吗？",
  "So what's up? You want me to do this or not?": "所以你怎么决定？这手术是做还是不做？",
  "So yeah, this is where it's gonna go down. Find a cover spot and go dark.": "所以，这就是我们要去的地方。找个隐蔽点，然后藏起来。",
  "So you gonna buy something, or...?": "所以你要买东西，还是……？",
  "So you know, I don't do refunds.": "所以您知道的，我这里不退款。",
  "So you know, this op might get a little dangerous.": "所以你知道的，这份任务可能会有点儿危险。",
  "So you know. I've given you a negative performance review on your last contract.": "所以你知道的，我给你的上一份合约，它的业绩评价很差。",
  "So, can I get you a slice?": "那么，要不我给您拿一片披萨？",
  "So, come on, talk to me.": "所以，来吧，跟我聊聊。",
  "So, did you want to get something or...?": "那么，您是想买点什么还是......？",
  "So, didn't find anything.": "所以呢，什么都没找到。",
  "So, how's everything going with you?": "所以，您最近怎么样了？",
  "So, it turns out, I might be in need of your services.": "看来，我可能需要你的帮助了。",
  "So, looks like my hunch was right. Still searching, but I'll find them.": "所以，看来我的预感是对的。我还在找，但我会找到的。",
  "So, not gonna do the contract after all? Thanks for wasting my time.": "所以，最后还是不打算完成合约了？谢谢你浪费我的时间。",
  "So, tell me a bit about what's going on with you?": "那么，跟我说说你的近况吧？",
  "So, there's a slight change of plans. Check it out.": "嗯，计划有一点点变动。去看一下。",
  "So, uh, do you mind keeping an eye out?": "嗯，你能保持警戒吗？",
  "So, what are we thinking?": "那么，你打算做什么？",
  "So, what's the job?": "所以，工作是什么？",
  "So, yeah... yeah... they're gone.": "所以，是……是……他们没了。",
  "So, you found us, huh? Well come on then, let's see what Pyro's lapdogs can do.": "所以，你找到我们了，嗯？来吧，让我们看看派罗的走狗们能干出什么名堂。",
  "So, you think you can take me? Well here I am! Hit me with your best shot.": "所以你觉得你能打败我？我现在就在这里等着！你就尽管放马过来吧。",
  "So, you think you'll do it?": "所以说，你想这么做？",
  "So, you're the escort, huh? Okay.": "所以，你就是护卫？行吧。",
  "So... I'm gonna have to move your ship... Cool?": "嗯...我可能得把你的飞船收进仓库里...成吗？",
  "So... I'm not exactly sure what happened here, but really hoping you can help.": "所以……我也不太清楚这里发生了什么，但真心希望你能帮帮我。",
  "So... find anything good?": "所以...找到什么好东西了吗？",
  "So... that favor you were doing for me? Yeah, forget it.": "所以…关于你帮我的那个忙？好吧，忘了它吧。",
  "So... that thing you were supposed to do for me? Yeah, forget it. You blew it.": "所以...就是你本来应该帮我办那件事？对的，忘了吧。你已经搞砸了。",
  "So... yeah... they're gone.": "所以……是的……他们走了。",
  "So... you ever been here before?": "所以...你以前来过吗？",
  "So?": "那又怎样？",
  "So? What's it gonna be?": "所以，你还有啥计划？",
  "So? Will you take it?": "所以呢？你会接受吗？",
  "Soap": "肥皂",
