  "Some impressive wet work, Marine.": "活干得好啊，陆战队员。",
  "Some microTech equipment is in need of servicing.": "一些微科设备需要维护。",
  "Some microTech property went missing during a recent transaction.": "一些属于微科的财产在最近的交易中失踪了。",
  "Some more supply ships got jumped. We need combat support to get out there.": "又有更多补给船被拦截了。我们需要战斗支援前去帮他们脱困。",
  "Some nerve. Charging these prices for this tritus.": "真敢卖啊，这破东西敢卖这么贵。",
  "Some of this stuff tends to go pretty fast, I'd get it while you can.": "有些东西卖得特别快，趁现在还有货赶紧下手吧。",
  "Some options are disabled due to insufficient materials.": "材料不足，某些选项无法使用。",
  "Some other time okay?": "改天再聊吧。",
  "Some other time, okay?": "换个时间，好吗？",
  "Some people think this job's boring. Not me. I like the challenge.": "有些人觉得这活没啥意思；但我不一样，我喜欢挑战。",
  "Some players are not ready": "有些玩家还没有准备好",
  "Some players do not have a ship selected": "有些玩家没有选择船",
