  "Some players do not have the required mission type permission": "有些玩家没有所需的任务类型许可",
  "Some players thrive in a time crisis. Let's see if any are playing tonight.": "有些球员在时间紧迫的情况下表现得非常出色，让我们看看今晚是否有人能够做到。",
  "Some registered items cannot be replaced due to being on cooldown": "部分注册物品尚在冷却，无法更换",
  "Some say three is an unlucky number.": "有人说三是个不吉利的数字。",
  "Some scout ships escaped": "侦察飞船逃脱",
  "Some strange ass stuff going on here. Gonna look into it.": "这里发生了一些奇怪的事，我要调查一下。",
  "Some strange ass stuff is going on. Gonna look into it.": "这里发生了一些奇怪的事，我要调查一下。",
  "Some target practice are flying in hot.": "有几个活靶子赶着送死来了。",
  "Some things are best left buried.": "有些东西最好埋起来。",
  "Some things just boggle the mind.": "有些事情让人匪夷所思。",
  "Somebody ain't afraid to get their hands dirty.": "有人不怕弄脏自己的手。",
  "Somebody broke in!": "有人闯进来了！",
  "Somebody call somebody!": "谁去叫点人来！",
  "Somebody came! Thank you. Thank you. You have to help me fight.": "有人来了！谢谢谢谢，你得帮我战斗才行。",
  "Somebody came! You gotta protect me. I'm trying to get my ship working again.": "终于有人来了！你得保护我，我正在尝试让我的船动起来。",
  "Somebody get these fighters.": "谁来把这些战斗机弄走。",
  "Somebody help me!": "来人帮帮我！",
  "Somebody help!": "来人啊！",
  "Somebody likes it rough, don't they.": "有些人就是喜欢来硬的，你说是不是。",
  "Somebody needs the ECN back on in this area. Didn't say why, and I didn't ask.": "有人想要那片区域的紧急通讯网络重新上线。没说为什么，我也不会问。",
  "Somebody please help me!": "随便谁来救救我吧！",
  "Somebody! Help me!": "来人救救我！",
  "Somebody's going to pay for this.": "有人要为此付出代价。",
  "Someone better not be messing with me.": "某些人最好别惹我。",
  "Someone cover me!": "来个人掩护我！",
  "Someone cover me?": "有人能掩护我吗？",
  "Someone else is around here, I swear.": "还有别人在这里，我发誓。",
  "Someone get eyes on this slippery bastard, now.": "来点人给我找找这狡猾的混蛋跑哪去了，就现在。",
  "Someone got dropped. Gonna look around and get to the bottom.": "有人死了，得四处查查有没有什么蛛丝马迹。",
  "Someone got knocked!": "有人被干了！",
  "Someone just got blasted.": "有人被打死了。",
  "Someone likes to fight dirty.": "看来有些人很喜欢用下下作手段。",
  "Someone lurkin'?": "有人潜伏在这里？",
  "Someone needs some stuff taken somewhere.": "有人想把一些东西送到某个地方去。",
  "Someone there?": "有人在那吗？",
  "Someone totally nicked your kill.": "有人抢了你的人头。",
  "Someone tried to blast me.": "有人想打我。",
  "Someone wanna call a medic? We got ourselves the first casualty.": "有人能叫一下医生吗？我们这出现了第一个伤员。",
  "Someone wants to tussle.": "有人想打架啊。",
  "Someone! Anyone! I need a heal.": "有人吗！随都行！我需要治疗。",
  "Someone's been hitting the sauce.": "有人喝醉了。",
  "Someone's definitely here. Just need to find them.": "绝对有人在这，得找到他们。",
  "Someone's feeling frisky.": "有人皮痒痒了是吧。",
  "Someone's gonna to pay for dropping this body.": "有人得一命换一命了。",
  "Someone's headhunting!": "有狙击手！",
  "Someone's helmet must be too tight because they are flying backwards.": "某人的头盔估计太小了，因为他正朝后飞。",
  "Someone's here. Don't know who... yet.": "有其他人在这里，但还不知道是谁。",
  "Someone's here. Find them.": "这里肯定有人。找到他们。",
  "Someone's running scared.": "有人要被吓跑了！",
  "Someone's shooting!": "有人在开火！",
  "Someone's willing to pay a nice little sum for you.": "有人愿意为你支付一笔不小的数目。",
  "Something I can do for you?": "有什么事我能帮你的？",
  "Something I can help you with?": "有什么事我能帮助你吗？",
  "Something cold please.": "请来点儿冰的。",
  "Something definitely moved in my periphery.": "周围肯定有什么东西在动。",
  "Something else?": "来点别的？",
  "Something exciting may have just popped up on my radar.": "我的雷达上好像出现了一些激动人心的东西。",
  "Something is seriously wrong with you.": "你脑子真的有病。",
  "Something on the side": "不足挂齿的副业",
  "Something special for ya.": "送你一份特殊的礼物。",
  "Something to gain, everything to lose.": "得不偿失。",
  "Something went wrong (Error code: ~RefineryMethod(error)).": "出错了 (错误代码：~RefineryMethod(error))。",
  "Something wrong?": "有什么问题吗？",
  "Something wrong? I still need more fuel.": "出什么问题了？我还需要更多燃料。",
  "Something's a bit off. Gonna take a look.": "感觉有点不太对劲。我得去看看。",
  "Something's going on. Taking a look.": "好像要出事，我检查一下。",
  "Something's not right here.": "这里有点不对劲。",
  "Something's not right.": "有点不对劲。",
