  "Sorry": "抱歉。",
  "Sorry I'll help you in a second.": "抱歉，我马上来。",
  "Sorry about killing your friend. Not really, but still.": "不好意哦，把你朋友杀了。其实并不，但还是客套一下。",
  "Sorry about that.": "对此很抱歉。",
  "Sorry about that. Didn't mean to shoot you.": "非常抱歉，我没想朝你开火。",
  "Sorry about the delay. We should be good to go.": "迟到了不好意思，我们可以走了。",
  "Sorry about this, but you?re not really giving me a choice here.": "我很抱歉，但是你让我没得可选。",
  "Sorry about this. You should've left.": "很抱歉，你就该走的。",
  "Sorry but I canceled your assignment.": "很抱歉，但我已经取消了给你的分配。",
  "Sorry but you've been denied access to this facility.": "抱歉，您被拒绝进入此设施。",
  "Sorry for the delay. We still haven't gotten official 'go' from the higher ups.": "抱歉耽搁了时间。我们还没有得到上级的正式批准。",
  "Sorry for the locale, don't look like much but the homemade stuff has some kick.": "抱歉叫你来这，看上去不咋滴，但这自制的东西还挺不错的。",
  "Sorry for the wait.": "抱歉久等了。",
  "Sorry it had to come to this, but glad you came out on top.": "很遗憾事情发展到这一步，但很高兴你最终取得了胜利。",
  "Sorry it took me so long to get here.": "抱歉，路上耽搁的时间有点长。",
  "Sorry sir, I can't": "对不起长官，做不到",
  "Sorry to do this, but we got a couple things to lock down before we head off.": "很抱歉，但我们出发前还得弄一些东西。",
  "Sorry! Wasn't shooting at you.": "抱歉，没想射你的。",
  "Sorry, I can't give you a spot with an active CrimeStat.": "对不起，我不能在你有犯罪等级的情况下给你安排位置。",
  "Sorry, I can't help you.": "抱歉，我帮不上你。",
  "Sorry, I can't help you. Have a look at the vehicle terminal.": "对不起，我无法帮助你。你应该去看看那边的载具终端。",
  "Sorry, I can't hold your deck spot any longer.": "抱歉，我不能再让你占着那片甲板。",
  "Sorry, I get going sometimes.": "抱歉，我有时会走神。",
  "Sorry, I just clocked out.": "不好意思，我刚到点下班。",
  "Sorry, I kinda have to focus here.": "对不起，我这边有事在忙。",
  "Sorry, I need to slip past.": "不好意思，借过一下。",
  "Sorry, I really can't talk right now.": "对不起，我现在真的不能聊天。",
  "Sorry, I thought you were the bad guy.": "对不起，我以为你是坏人。",
  "Sorry, I will be with you momentarily.": "对不起，我马上就来。",
  "Sorry, I'll be with you shortly.": "抱歉啊，我马上过去。",
  "Sorry, I'll help you in a second.": "抱歉，我马上来为您服务。",
  "Sorry, I'm a little swamped right now.": "抱歉，我现在有些忙。",
  "Sorry, I'm not supposed to a break yet.": "抱歉，还不到我休息的时候。",
  "Sorry, I'm still working. I should be done soon.": "对不起，我还在努力，应该很快就好了。",
  "Sorry, I'm too damaged.": "抱歉，我支撑不住了。",
  "Sorry, buddy, People's Alliance members only.": "抱歉，老兄，这里仅限人民联盟成员。",
  "Sorry, but I need you to keep a little closer than that.": "不好意思，我需要你靠近一点。",
  "Sorry, but there are still a couple ships coming. I wonder where they are...": "对不起，但是还有几艘船正在路上，不知道他们到哪里了。",
  "Sorry, can't let you past.": "抱歉，你不准过去。",
  "Sorry, can't make it to you.": "对不起，我去不了你那。",
  "Sorry, can't really talk right now.": "不好意思，现在不方便说话。",
  "Sorry, can't.": "抱歉，我帮不上忙。",
  "Sorry, could I just slip past?": "不好意思，我能过去吗？",
  "Sorry, could you stop that?": "对不起，你能停下吗？",
  "Sorry, customers are strictly on a stay on that side sort of thing.": "抱歉，我想客人应该只能待在那一边。",
  "Sorry, did you want to order something?": "不好意思，您刚才是要点喝的吗？",
  "Sorry, didn't mean nothing.": "对不起，不是有意的。",
  "Sorry, do you need a drink?": "抱歉，您想要什么喝的？",
  "Sorry, hate to do this, but I gotta run.": "不好意思，我得走了。",
  "Sorry, i'll help you in a second.": "不好意思，我待会再来帮你。",
  "Sorry, it'll be just one second.": "抱歉，稍等一下。",
  "Sorry, just moving through.": "不好意思，我过去一下。",
  "Sorry, killer. Nothing personal, but you ain’t leaving this place alive.": "抱歉，杀手。没别的意思，但你是没法活着走出这里的。",
  "Sorry, my fault.": "抱歉，我的错。",
  "Sorry, my shift's over.": "对不起，我下班了。",
  "Sorry, need to get past.": "对不起，借过一下。",
  "Sorry, no time for pain killers.": "不好意思，没时间打麻药了。",
  "Sorry, no.": "对不起，不行。",
  "Sorry, posito, the Wallace Klim Employment Office is closed for the day.": "抱歉伙计，今天华莱士·克里姆职业介绍所暂时歇业。",
  "Sorry, situation's gotten more complicated, so I gotta pull the plug on the op.": "对不起，情况变得更复杂了，所以我得终止这次行动。",
  "Sorry, sorry": "抱歉，抱歉",
  "Sorry, still clearing up some paperwork for the bosses.": "抱歉，我还在为老板清理一些文件。",
  "Sorry, that's on back order right now.": "对不起，这个暂时没货了。",
  "Sorry, there are currently no rooms available": "抱歉，目前暂无可用医疗室",
  "Sorry, there's nothing I can do.": "对不起，我无能为力。",
  "Sorry, this area's off limits.": "对不起，这片区域是禁区。",
  "Sorry, very busy at the moment, but have a look around.": "对不起，现在很忙，但请随意看看。",
  "Sorry, yeah, I think you want the Cargo Terminal. That should help you.": "抱歉，当然，我想你要去货物终端。它应该能帮到你。",
  "Sorry, you can't come through here.": "对不起，你不能通过这里。",
  "Sorry, you can't do that in here.": "对不起，您不能在这里这么做。",
  "Sorry, you got me confused with someone else.": "对不起，你是不是认错人了。",
  "Sorry, you really can't be back here.": "不好意思，你真不该到这后面来。",
  "Sorry, you've been denied access.": "抱歉，还不能让你过去。",
  "Sorry, your access has been denied": "抱歉，你不能过去。",
  "Sorry.": "抱歉。",
  "Sorry. Can't help you.": "抱歉，帮不上你。",
  "Sorry. Got nothing for you.": "不好意思，没有给你的任务。",
  "Sorry. I can't.": "抱歉，我做不到",
  "Sorry. If you can't decide I'm going to have to help other people.": "抱歉。如果你下不了决定的话，我就把这机会让给别人了。",
  "Sorry. If you don't have the credits, I can't let you land.": "如果你没带钱的话，我实在没法让你在这里降落，抱歉。",
  "Sorry. My fault.": "抱歉。我的错。",
  "Sorry. Shot got away from me.": "抱歉，走火了。",
  "Sorry. you can't come through here.": "抱歉，但你不能进来这。",
