  "Sure as hell can’t go on like this. Something needs to be done.": "这样下去绝对不行，必须采取行动。",
  "Sure as hell glad you're here.": "有你在这儿帮忙可真是太好了。",
  "Sure glad you showed up. That's a hellva haul you brought in.": "很高兴你来了，这批收获可不少啊。",
  "Sure hope they had their affairs in order.": "希望他们把后事都安排妥当了。",
  "Sure sweetheart, just keep walking.": "好吧，小甜心，就这样无情的走过去。",
  "Sure thing, boss.": "没问题，老大。",
  "Sure thing.": "当然。",
  "Sure thing. I'll begin the final prep now. Please stand by.": "好的。我现在就开始最后的准备。请稍候。",
  "Sure thing. That's my specialty.": "没问题，我最擅长调这种酒。",
  "Sure thing. We'll talk soon.": "好吧，回聊。",
  "Sure, go ahead.": "当然，继续。",
  "Sure, if that's what's best.": "好吧，如果那样是最好的。",
  "Sure, just keep walking.": "可以啊，视若无睹的走过去你良心不痛啊。",
  "Sure, sometimes I like to take everything in too.": "当然，有时我也喜欢多考虑一下。",
  "Sure, think it over.": "好的，您再仔细想想。",
  "Sure, we got a special welcome planned.": "当然，我们有一个特别的欢迎计划。",
  "Sure, why waste time.": "好啊，何必浪费时间呢。",
  "Sure, you just keep walking.": "好啊，就这样走过去。",
  "Sure.": "收到。",
  "Sure. Fine.": "行吧，好的。",
  "Sure. Free empire, right? Good luck in your next race": "行。这就是自由的帝国，对吧？祝你下圈比赛顺利。",
  "Sure. I can lend you a hand. Let me just wrap up this and I'll be right over.": "当然，我可以帮你。 让我把手头的活做完就来。",
  "Sure. Ignore me.": "没问题，别管我。",
  "Sure. Just go into any of the unoccupied changing room.": "当然可以，只要进入无人的更衣室就可以了。",
  "Sure. One Hot Coco.": "没问题，一杯热可可。",
  "Sure. One second.": "当然。马上好。",
  "Sure. We have this easy form you can fill out.": "当然可以，我们有一份简单的表格，您可以填写。",
  "Sure. Whatever you say, Mendo.": "当然了门多，你说什么我都照做。",
  "Sure. Why not.": "当然，为什么不呢。",
  "Sure... Leave me waiting here. It's not like I have anything better to do.": "行啊……把我晾在这儿等着吧。反正我也没别的更好的事可干。",
  "Sure... okay...": "确定……好吧……",
