  "That was some good flying.": "你来得很及时。",
  "That was some mystical, next-level shit you pulled on that last job.": "你在上次那活儿里的表现爆表，简直堪称魔法。",
  "That was some nice flying.": "这趟飞的不错啊。",
  "That was some pretty fantastic flying you just did.": "你刚才飞得真是棒极了。",
  "That was some sick flying last race. I knew I could count on you.": "上场比赛你飞得可厉害了，我就知道能指望你。",
