  "That was the last scan we needed. Thanks for the help.": "那是我们需要的最后一次扫描。谢谢你的帮助。",
  "That was touch and go for a while. Still not sure how we pulled it off.": "刚才真的好险，不知道我们是怎么挺过来的。",
