  "That was... that was crazy. A little exciting, I'll admit, but crazy.": "这...这有点儿惊险。我得说，挺刺激的，但是很惊险。",
  "That was... that was terrible! How can people choose this as a job? It's mental.": "这...这也太可怕了！怎么会有人做这种工作？简直疯了。",
  "That wasn't even close.": "都不知道射哪儿去了。",
  "That wasn't so bad was it?": "还不算太糟，对吧？",
  "That will do it for me, Trevor Basque. See you next time.": "对我来说足够了，特雷弗·巴斯克。下次再见。",
  "That works.": "这个管用。",
  "That'll buff right out.": "谢谢你帮我抛光。",
