  "That'll teach them not to bunch together.": "这样他们就不敢聚在一起了。",
  "That'll teach them not to mess with the ICC!": "给他们好好上一课，别来招惹 ICC！",
  "That's All": "就这样",
  "That's a bit much.": "有点过了。",
  "That's a bit of a mess.": "这可有点儿乱。",
