  "That's a bullshit play right there.": "你可真是干了个好事。",
  "That's a confirmed kill. Quite an end for a longtime criminal like Kelvin.": "已确认击杀。对于凯尔文这种法外狂徒来说真的是罪有应得。",
  "That's a damn grenade!": "是他妈的手雷！",
  "That's a damn rocket!": "他妈的，火箭弹！",
