  "That's all.": "就这样吧。",
  "That's all? Sure I can't interest you anything else?": "这样就好了？没别的想要的了？",
  "That's all? You're sure I cannot interest you in anything else?": "就这些啦？不再多挑点儿？",
  "That's amazing.": "太棒了。",
  "That's amazing. Thank you so much for completing that contract.": "太棒了。谢谢你完成了合约。",
  "That's another Idris down.": "又干掉一艘伊德里斯。",
  "That's another lap complete for our lone surviving ship.": "我们唯一的幸存者刚刚又完成了一圈。",
  "That's another of Crusader's ships destroyed. Not good.": "又一艘十字军的飞船被摧毁了，不妙。",
  "That's another one for us.": "我们又干掉一个。",
  "That's awesome!": "太棒了！",
  "That's awful.": "太可怕了。",
  "That's better. Resuming refueling process.": "这样更好。继续加油。",
  "That's concerning.": "我有点担心。",
  "That's defo worth investigating.": "刚才那个得去调查一下。",
  "That's doesn't really seem fair.": "这可不公平。",
  "That's everyone, right?": "这是最后一架了，对吧？",
  "That's everyone.": "人都齐了。",
  "That's everything. Let's call it a day and head back.": "这就是全部的事了，今天就到这儿，返航吧。",
  "That's everything. Let's go.": "都准备好了，出发吧。",
