  "That's fantastic. Cheers to that.": "太好了，为那个干杯。",
  "That's fantastic. I could hug you right now.": "太棒了，我想好好抱抱你。",
  "That's fascinating.": "太有意思了。",
  "That's fine.": "这样就好。",
  "That's fine. I can hopefully find someone else to handle it.": "这很好，我希望能找别人来处理这件事。",
  "That's fine. You do you.": "没关系。你做你的。",
  "That's frikkin' sweet.": "这也太爽啦。",
  "That's gonna be trouble. Better expect some reinforcements.": "那会很麻烦。最好等着增援。",
  "That's gonna leave a mark.": "这会在船上留个划痕的。",
  "That's good.": "不错。",
  "That's great news.": "真是好消息。",
  "That's great!": "太好了！",
  "That's great.": "太好看了。",
  "That's great. I think you'll really like this.": "太好了，我觉得你真的会喜欢这个。",
  "That's great. Let's hope tomorrow is even better.": "不错啊，希望明天会更好。",
  "That's great. Seeing the fuel transfer now.": "太好了。我这边已经看到燃料开始传输了。",
