  "That's impossible... nothing's there.": "这不可能……那什么都没。",
  "That's impressive I guess.": "那还挺震撼的。",
  "That's interesting...": "这真有趣...",
  "That's it coming up.": "就是这儿了，跟上。",
  "That's it for me.": "够了，不喝了。",
  "That's it for us. Time to head back.": "我们完事儿了，是时候回去了。",
