  "That's it! I'm reporting you.": "决定了！我要举报你。",
  "That's it! Idris is destroyed! Repeat. XenoThreat Idris has been dusted.": "棒极了！伊德里斯已毁！重复。伊德里斯已毁！",
  "That's it! They're giving up! We did it!": "好了！他们放弃了！我们成功了！",
  "That's it! We're all set!": "好了！我们搞定了！",
  "That's it! We're done!": "行了，我们做完了！",
  "That's it! We're good to go.": "好了！我们可以走了！",
  "That's it! We're good!": "搞定！我们好了！",
  "That's it! We're not friends anymore!": "行了！我不想当你友军了",
  "That's it, that's it,  that's it, that's it, That's it yeah..yeah. OHHH What?!?": "就是这样，就是这样，就是这样，就是这样，就是这样。啊，什么鬼? ! ?",
  "That's it, you got to leave.": "就这样，你可以走了。",
