  "That's it. Once I clear out, it'll be your turn.": "就是这样。等我结束，就到你。",
  "That's it. Radar is clear of enemies. Area secure.": "行了，雷达上的敌对目标已全数清除；区域已安全。",
  "That's it. Ready to go. Thanks again and sorry for the trouble.": "好了。我可以走了。再次谢谢你，也抱歉给你添麻烦了。",
  "That's it. That's all of their capships.": "就这了，这是他们所有的主力舰。",
  "That's it. The herd's been thinned out. We're down to the final few.": "就这样了，选手已经剩下不多了。",
