  "That's it. You're dead.": "行了，你死定了。",
  "That's it. You're doing a helluva job.": "就是这样，你做的很棒。",
  "That's it. You're done.": "就这样，你完蛋了。",
  "That's it. You're fired!": "够了，你被解雇了！",
  "That's it. You're toast.": "成了，你死定了。",
  "That's it? I'm just getting started.": "就这？我才刚刚开始。",
  "That's kinda okay.": "还可以。",
  "That's kinda underwhelming.": "其实也就一般吧。",
  "That's kinda weak.": "不太好看。",
  "That's more than I can pay.": "这个价我付不起。",
  "That's nice.": "那不错。",
  "That's not a good idea, okay. Back off while you still can.": "那可不是什么好主意。你最好趁还有机会的时候停手。",
  "That's not gonna work for me.": "这在我这儿行不通。",
  "That's not good.": "这可不好。",
  "That's not really my thing, you know?": "那些东西我真不清楚，你知道吧？",
  "That's not right. I'm going to check it out.": "有些不对劲，我去看看怎么了。",
  "That's not right. I'm going to go check it out.": "有些不对劲，我去看看怎么了。",
  "That's nuts.": "真是疯了。",
  "That's on you.": "这得赖你。",
  "That's one big bastard!": "有个大只的混蛋来了！",
  "That's one for me.": "吃我一发。",
  "That's one for us.": "这是我们努力来的。",
  "That's one less Nine Tails to worry about.": "又少了个九尾需要我们担心。",
  "That's one more data packet. Shoudn't be too many more left for you to find.": "那又是一个数据包。剩下的应该不多了，你很快就能找到。",
