  "That's really good news.": "这可真是好消息。",
  "That's really great.": "那可真是棒棒。",
  "That's really interesting.": "这也太有趣了。",
  "That's right. I got friends, and they're gonna kick you're ass.": "这就对了。我朋友来了，他们会好好教训你的。",
