  "That's sure something...": "那可真是……",
  "That's that. I guess.": "也就这样了，我想。",
  "That's that. Thank you for your help.": "就是这样，谢谢你的帮助。",
  "That's the client. Do whatever you have to do to keep 'em safe.": "那就是客户，尽你所能保证他们的安全。",
