  "Uh oh. That runner from before brought some reinforcements.": "啊哦，之前那个逃跑的家伙带了些增援来。",
  "Uh oh. They don't look friendly.": "呃噢，他们看起来并不友好。",
  "Uh oh. They got away. I'd expect them to get reinforcements soon.": "啊哦。他们逃跑了。我想他们很快就会获得增援。",
  "Uh uh, no fighting!": "禁止斗殴！",
  "Uh uh, no way.": "没门儿。",
  "Uh uh. No way. You gotta go. Now.": "哦噢，没门儿。你现在就得离开。",
  "Uh uh. You can't do that in here.": "额，你不能在这干这事。",
  "Uh yeah, yeah, this'll work.": "额，对，对，就是这个。",
  "Uh! We lost a friendly.": "唔！我们失去了一个友军。",
  "Uh, I don't... I don't understand. How can you just lose a ship.": "呃，我不...不明白。你是怎么能弄丢一条船的。",
  "Uh, I love this song.": "哦，我爱死这首歌了。",
  "Uh, You got a spot to land. Just waiting for you. So... Let's get landing.": "呃...你已经有地方可停了，所以...为啥不去呢。",
  "Uh, balls.": "呃，玩个球。",
  "Uh, hey, your ship's sorta in the way. Think you could move?": "额...嘿！你的船稍微有点挡道，能挪一下吗？",
  "Uh, hey. My shields are down. Maybe a little help.": "呃，嘿。我的护盾失效了，帮帮我。",
  "Uh, if you hadn't noticed, you didn't finish refueling me.": "呃，要是你没注意到的话，你还没把我的油加完。",
  "Uh, listen. I'm sorry, but I can't let you in. Council's orders. Sorry.": "嗯...听我说...我很抱歉，我不能放你进来，委员会的决定，抱歉。",
  "Uh, pardon me.": "呃，不好意思。",
  "Uh, what do you think those terminals are for?": "呃，你觉得那些终端机是用来做什么的？",
  "Uh, what do you think those terminals for?": "呃，你觉得那些终端机是用来做什么的？",
  "Uh, you're gonna be in hangar three.": "额，给你安排了3号机库。",
  "Uh-huh.": "嗯哼。",
  "Uh... This is a joke, right? Right?! They were expecting these... shit!": "呃，这是一个玩笑，对吗？对吧？他们期待着这些... 狗屎！",
  "Uh... does anyone know where they went?": "呃，有人知道他们去哪了？",
  "Uh... no.": "呃……不。",
  "Uh... okay ...": "额...好吧...",
  "Uh... they don't look friendly.": "额...他们看起来不太友好。",
  "Uh... you already have a spot.": "呃...你已经有一个位置了。",
  "Uh.... they got a ship!": "呃……他们有飞船！",
  "Uh? are you gonna take your drink?": "呃，这杯酒你还喝吗？",
  "Uhm... okay...": "嗯...好吧...",
  "Uh… hello? We haven't finished the refueling.": "呃...喂？我们还没加完油呢。",
  "Uh… you know we're not done yet, right?": "呃……你知道我们还没结束吧？",
