  "What's your twenty? We need your help out here.": "你那边怎样？我这里需要你的帮助。",
  "What, are you helping them?! I'm the one who's paying you!": "啥？你是那边的人吗？！付你钱的是我！",
  "What, are you on a break? Get back here or find another job.": "什么？你在摸鱼？回来干活，不然就找别的工作去吧。",
  "What, did you think I was bullshitting you?": "什么，你以为我在开玩笑？",
  "What, did you think this was gonna be easy?": "什么，你以为这会很轻松吗？",
  "What, is it laundry day?": "怎么，今天是洗衣日吗？",
  "What, what to you got.": "什么，你拿了什么。",
  "What, you come to collect?": "什么？你是来这里收钱的？",
  "What, you thought you could just cash in on my people and walk away?": "怎么，你以为可以贿赂我的人然后就这么走了吗？",
  "What, you want credits? Fine. I don't care. Here.": "什么你想要钱？好，我不在乎，都给你。",
  "What, you want me to beg? Screw you.": "什么？想让我求饶？去你妈的。",
  "What, you want money?": "什么，你想要钱吗？",
