  "What...": "啥...",
  "What... is this some kind of joke?": "什么……这是在开玩笑吗?",
  "What?": "什么？",
  "What? Am I on Fake Outs? No one could possibly fly this bad in real life.": "啥？你是在唬我吗？没人能飞这么烂吧？",
  "What? I can't, my god what am I gonna tell her? Shit": "什么？我不能，天啊，我该怎么跟她说？操了。",
