  "What?!": "什么？！",
  "What?! You... You..you can't quit... dammit!": "什么？你... 你... ...你不能不干了... ...该死的！",
  "Whatcha want?": "您要啥？",
  "Whatever it is you want, just be quick, okay?": "不管你想要什么，动作快点，好吗？",
