  "Whatever it was its gone now.": "不管是啥，都已经溜了。",
  "Whatever the price on my head is, I hope its worth your life.": "无论我头上有多少赏金，希望那钱值得你送死。",
  "Whatever they're paying you for me, I can tell you now it's not nearly enough.": "无论他们为了我给你多少钱，我现在可以告诉你是远远不够的。",
  "Whatever you say.": "请随意。",
  "Whatever you're getting paid for this, it's not worth it.": "再多钱也不值你送命。",
  "Whatever you're gonna do, do it now!": "如果你还有啥绝活，现在使出来！",
  "Whatever, they got a point": "无所谓了，他们得了一分",
  "Whatever, this ain't gonna be the end of me.": "随便，我不会在这死的。",
  "Whatever.": "无所谓。",
