  "Who are the People Working for Crusader?": "哪些人为十字军工作？",
  "Who are they?": "他们是谁？",
  "Who are you?!": "你是谁？！",
  "Who can spare a mag?": "谁分个弹匣给我？",
  "Who do we have here?": "这是谁来了？",
  "Who do you think's gonna win? Me or you?": "你觉得谁能赢？你还是我？",
  "Who ever did this is probably still here. Find them.": "不论是谁干的，他肯定还没跑远。找到他们。",
  "Who invited these assholes?": "谁邀请的这帮混蛋？",
  "Who killed 'em? Was this one of you?": "谁杀了他们？这是你的人吗？",
  "Who knows though, maybe you'll actually complete the next contract.": "谁又知道呢，没准您能按时完成下一个合约。",
