  "With Jata's win this round, this match is one point closer to being decided.": "随着亚塔队在本轮获胜，本场比赛离决出胜负又近了一分。",
  "With a careful eye, the combatants pick their loadouts.": "战斗员们小心翼翼地挑选着自己的装备。",
  "With a little patience, even mistakes can grow into opportunities.": "塞翁失马，焉知非福",
