  "With only one racer left, basically every lap they finish is a victory lap.": "只剩下一名赛车手，跑圈就是胜利。",
  "With only one racer left, it's like every lap they finish is a victory lap.": "只剩下一名赛车手，每一圈都是胜利圈。",
  "With pleasure.": "乐意之至。",
  "With results like these... there's always next year, I suppose.": "这样的结果...我想年年总是会有的。",
  "With round off to a strong start, the ready room is sterilized.": "为了给本轮比赛开一个好头，准备室进行了消毒。",
  "With selections made, we're just moments away.": "选择好后，我们就可以开始了。",
  "With some careful aiming, Angeli lay out a tight defense.": "安吉利队深思熟虑后，布下了铜墙铁壁般的防守。",
