  "With that decisive shot, the carrier is halted in their tracks.": "这决定性的一击让持球者停下了脚步。",
  "With that, Jata ZGCC's final player is out, ending the round.": "至此，亚塔ZGCC队的最后一名选手出局，本轮比赛结束。",
  "With that, the match has begun.": "比赛就此开始。",
  "With the Aeros' win that round, this match is one point closer to being decided.": "随着航天队在本轮获胜，本场比赛离决出胜负又近了一分。",
  "With the amount you're missing I'm starting to think you're on their side.": "你这命中率我都开始觉得你和他们一伙的。",
