  "Yeah yeah yeah yeah...": "嗯，对，没错……",
  "Yeah yeah, screw you.": "好啊，好啊，可去你丫的。",
  "Yeah you got my shields, but who needs 'em.": "嗯，你把我盾打掉了，但猛男不需要护盾。",
  "Yeah!": "耶!",
  "Yeah! Bet they're regrettin' messin' with my station now!": "好！我敢打赌他们现在绝对后悔来我的站点捣乱了！",
  "Yeah! Burn baby!": "耶！给爷烧！",
  "Yeah! I got you so good.": "耶！我这下干得你爽吧！",
  "Yeah! Just like that.": "哈！就像那样！",
  "Yeah! Let's do it! Guns and thrusters! Full burn!": "哦耶！搞起来！枪炮和引擎！马力全开！",
  "Yeah! That's what you get!": "耶！你活该！",
  "Yeah! Way to go guys. One point to us!": "耶!该走了伙计们.我们获得一分!",
  "Yeah! We got a point!": "耶!我们获得了一分!",
  "Yeah! You blew 'em up real good!": "耶！你把他们射爆了！",
  "Yeah! You see that? We got you! You're done for now.": "哈！你看到了没？我们抓到你了！你要完犊子了。",
  "Yeah, I already told you.": "是的，已经告诉你了。",
  "Yeah, I can hear you. Go ahead.": "是的，我能听到你说话，继续吧。",
  "Yeah, I can help. Just give me a sec.": "好的，我会来的，只是给我点时间。",
  "Yeah, I could see wanting to buy something like this.": "嗯，我确实有点想买这个。",
  "Yeah, I definitely wouldn't get that.": "是啊，我绝对不会买那个。",
  "Yeah, I didn't see anything.": "是，我什么都没看到。",
  "Yeah, I don't know what happened, but they're gone.": "是的，我也不知道怎么回事，但是他们就这么消失了。",
  "Yeah, I don't know. Command's got no clue what they're doing.": "嗯，我也不懂。指挥对他们这行为也一点头绪都没有。",
  "Yeah, I don't know. Sounds stressful.": "是啊，我不知道。听起来压力很大。",
  "Yeah, I don't think I'm gonna do that.": "嗯，我可不会这么干。",
  "Yeah, I feel that.": "是的，我也觉得。",
  "Yeah, I get it, I get it.": "好的，知道了，知道了。",
  "Yeah, I got ya.": "对，我来帮你。",
  "Yeah, I guess I could help": "行，我可以帮忙。",
  "Yeah, I have no idea what you're talking about.": "是啊，我不知道你在说什么。",
  "Yeah, I heard it too.": "没错，我也听到了。",
  "Yeah, I heard that.": "对，我听到了。",
  "Yeah, I know what that's like. One of these days I'm just gonna up and quit.": "好吧，我知道那是什么感觉。每一天我都想直接辞职走人算了。",
  "Yeah, I really recommend that one.": "是啊，我真的很推荐那个。",
  "Yeah, I remember you.": "是的，我记得你。",
  "Yeah, I see you. Gimme a minute.": "好的，我看见你了，稍等。",
  "Yeah, I should probably get going too.": "嗯，我也该走了。",
  "Yeah, I think I heard something.": "对，我也听见了。",
  "Yeah, I think I saw it too.": "是的，我想我也看见了。",
  "Yeah, I think I'll give it a shot.": "行，我想我会试试。",
  "Yeah, I think we're through here.": "嗯，我跟你没什么可谈的了。",
  "Yeah, I think you might've had enough already, boss.": "嗯，看来你今晚已经玩的够本了，老大。",
  "Yeah, I thought you might take it.": "对，我就知道您会买的。",
  "Yeah, I wouldn?t get it if I were you.": "嗯，如果我是你的话不会买这个。",
  "Yeah, I'd wait and see if you can find something cheaper.": "好的，我会等你看看能不能找到更便宜的。",
  "Yeah, I'll get to the bottom of it.": "好，我会查个水落石出。",
  "Yeah, I'm about ready too. Let's go.": "嗯，我也差不多看完了。我们走吧。",
  "Yeah, I'm all out.": "是的，我用完了。",
  "Yeah, I'm doing good. Really, really good.": "我挺好的，好得不能再好了。",
  "Yeah, I'm done here.": "好了，我完事儿了。",
  "Yeah, I'm not sure we're gonna be getting any more of that it.": "是啊，不知道我们会不会进更多那东西。",
  "Yeah, I'm not sure. Maybe try the terminal.": "嗯，我也不清楚，你可以试试终端。",
  "Yeah, I'm running on fumes here.": "好耶，我快没燃料了",
  "Yeah, Maybe got something. going to keep looking.": "对，也许发现了什么，继续搜索。",
  "Yeah, Orison is great. Even that Stormwal mascot is starting to grow on me.": "是的，奥里森很棒。我越来越喜欢那些风暴鲸的公仔了。",
  "Yeah, Star Runner could be a good choice to move some people to other platforms.": "对，星际快运船会是把人转移到其他平台的好选择。",
  "Yeah, Yeah": "好的好的",
  "Yeah, all right, I'll give you that one.": "哟，还挺厉害。",
  "Yeah, all right, have fun with your life.": "好吧，随你开心吧。",
  "Yeah, all right.": "行吧，好吧。",
  "Yeah, all right. Nothing else here. Head on off.": "好的，好的。这里没别的了。出发吧。",
  "Yeah, all right. That was a good scrap?": "行吧，好吧。那只是一堆好的垃圾？",
  "Yeah, couldn't find anything.": "是，什么都没找到。",
  "Yeah, didn't see anything.": "对，什么都没找到。",
  "Yeah, doesn't sound great.": "是的，听起来不怎么样。",
  "Yeah, don't see shit.": "是，啥鬼玩意都没看到。",
  "Yeah, fine, guess I'll babysit": "好吧，看来我得照顾他们了",
  "Yeah, fine.": "好，行吧。",
  "Yeah, gonna keep looking.": "对，继续搜。",
  "Yeah, got one!": "好耶，干掉一个！",
  "Yeah, great.": "呵，好看。",
  "Yeah, heard something.": "对，我听到些什么。",
  "Yeah, hey, I didn't find anything.": "对，嘿，我什么都没找到。",
  "Yeah, hey.": "哈喽，您好啊。",
  "Yeah, if they haven't turned up yet, I don't think they're going to.": "好吧，如果他们到现在还没出现，我觉得他们是不会来了。",
  "Yeah, it didn't like that.": "是的，它并不是那样。",
  "Yeah, it looks like you don't have enough credits.": "是的，看起来您没有足够的资金。",
  "Yeah, it was a bit of a snoozer.": "是啊，现在的情况是有些低迷。",
  "Yeah, it's definitely got the Cousin Crow feel down.": "没错，就是乌鸦表哥内味儿。",
  "Yeah, it's perfect. You should totally buy that.": "是，那玩意很不错的。您得买点。",
  "Yeah, keep moving. Tire yourself out.": "哈，继续跑。累不死你。",
  "Yeah, lemme get a drink.": "好，等我拿杯酒来。",
