  "Yeah, looks pretty good to me.": "嗯，我也觉得挺不错。",
  "Yeah, maybe check the terminal if you have questions.": "嗯，如果你有问题的话可以试试终端。",
  "Yeah, no idea was that satellite is. Take it out.": "是，我也不知道那个卫星是什么，搞定它。",
  "Yeah, no.": "呃，不行。",
  "Yeah, not a chance of that happening. You're pretty much out of luck.": "是啊，那几乎不可能发生的，你真是倒霉透了。",
  "Yeah, not right now.": "哈，不是现在。",
  "Yeah, not sure we're gonna be getting more of that in.": "是啊，不知道那玩意儿的补货什么时候到。",
  "Yeah, not sure when we're going to be getting more of that in.": "是啊，不知道那玩意儿的补货什么时候到。",
  "Yeah, now all I need to figure out is a way to get a big fat raise.": "好吧，现在我要考虑的就是怎么加薪了。",
