  "Yeah, ok... not like this was important or anything.": "是的，好吧…这也没什么大不了的。",
  "Yeah, ok... not like this was important or anything. Don't worry": "是的，好吧…这也没什么大不了的。别担心。",
  "Yeah, okay, find a good spot and power down.": "是啊，对，找个好地方，把电源关掉。",
  "Yeah, okay, let's go.": "嗯，好了，我们走吧。",
  "Yeah, okay, this has got to get done, so hit me up if anything changes.": "行，好吧。这活儿必须得完成。等你改主意了就联系我。",
  "Yeah, okay.": "好，好的。",
  "Yeah, on it.": "好的，正在攻击。",
  "Yeah, pretend like you don't see me.": "行啊，就当没看到我一样。",
  "Yeah, right": "是的，没错",
  "Yeah, right.": "是的，没错。",
  "Yeah, right. I don't think so.": "哦，真的吗，我不信。",
  "Yeah, right. Like I'm gonna drop everything just to bail you out.": "好哦，就像我真的能放下手头的所有活儿来帮你似的。",
  "Yeah, saw something too.": "是的，我也看到什么东西了。",
  "Yeah, see ya.": "拜拜了您嘞。",
  "Yeah, she's staying strong.": "她现在状态良好",
  "Yeah, something's not right.": "对，有什么地方不对劲。",
  "Yeah, sorry, I can't really help you.": "是，抱歉，我真的帮不到你。",
  "Yeah, sorry, I'm right in the middle of something.": "是啊，对不起，我正忙着呢。",
  "Yeah, sorry. I'm really busy.": "是的，不好意思，我真的很忙。",
  "Yeah, speak.": "好吧，说吧。",
  "Yeah, strangest thing, I can't find anything.": "对，最奇怪的是，我什么都找不到。",
  "Yeah, sure.": "嗯，好的。",
  "Yeah, sure. Why wouldn't I be?": "当然了，为啥觉得我没有？",
  "Yeah, target's down.": "好的，击中目标。",
  "Yeah, tell me about it, if it ain't one thing it's another.": "是啊，说来听听，反正不是这个就是那个。",
  "Yeah, that one hurt.": "那一下挺厉害。",
  "Yeah, that press is going nowhere with the carrier locked.": "是的，在持球者被锁定的情况下，他哪也去不了。",
  "Yeah, that satellite's one of ours. Don't mess with it.": "对，那个卫星是我们的，别乱搞它。",
  "Yeah, that sounded suspicious.": "是的，听起来很可疑。",
  "Yeah, that's Captain Lucas.": "是的，那是卢卡斯船长。",
  "Yeah, that's a rocket launcher!": "对，那是火箭筒！",
  "Yeah, that's a ship!": "是的，那是飞船！",
  "Yeah, that's how you do it!": "哈，就是这么干的！",
  "Yeah, that's it!": "没错，就是这样！",
  "Yeah, that's right!": "是的，就是这样！",
  "Yeah, that's the asshole we want.": "没错，就是我们要找的那个混蛋。",
  "Yeah, that's what you get.": "唷，这就是你的下场。",
  "Yeah, the lines of it are real nice.": "哦是的，她的线条很棒。",
  "Yeah, there's nothing I can do. It's going to have to come off.": "嗯，我也无能为力。这东西必须切掉。",
  "Yeah, they gave me the slip. But not for long.": "对，他们把我甩掉了。但这不会持续多久的。",
  "Yeah, they must be gone.": "对，他们肯定是走了。",
  "Yeah, they pay for protection, so you better go help them out.": "没错，他们付了保护费，所以你最好去帮帮他们。",
  "Yeah, they'll burn. They'll burn like all the rest.": "是的，他们会被烧死。他们会像其他所有人一样被烧死。",
  "Yeah, they're dead. Send a comm and let them know the job's done.": "对，他们死了。发个消息告诉他们，活干完了。",
  "Yeah, they're either gone or hiding real good. I'll do another sweep.": "对，他们要么跑了，要么藏得很好。我会再找一遍。",
  "Yeah, they're gone.": "他们跑了。",
  "Yeah, they're long gone.": "是的，他们早就溜了。",
  "Yeah, this is all right.": "对，这样就行。",
  "Yeah, this is good. What do you think about your drink?": "嗯，这个真好喝。你觉得你那杯如何？",
  "Yeah, this'll work.": "是的，就是这个。",
  "Yeah, thought so": "是的，我也这么想。",
  "Yeah, thought so.": "是的，我也这么想。",
  "Yeah, took a look and nothing.": "对，我看了一眼，什么都没有。",
  "Yeah, tossing one their way.": "听着，在他们来的路上扔一枚。",
  "Yeah, we don't have them anymore. How the hell should I know?": "对，我们没找到他们。我他妈怎么知道？",
  "Yeah, we got something here. Heading in.": "对，我们这里有点情况。在找了。",
  "Yeah, we had a bit of a long day, all armed up and no one to shoot.": "是的，我们这一天也有点不好受，全副武装但是一枪都开不了。",
  "Yeah, we lost one!": "对，我们没了一个！",
  "Yeah, we need some backup here.": "是的，我们需要支援。",
  "Yeah, we're clear here.": "对，我们已经清空了这里。",
  "Yeah, we're gonna have to park you up in the garage.": "是的，我们可以帮你把车停进车库里。",
  "Yeah, we're good here.": "嗯，我们这儿挺好的。",
  "Yeah, welcome to Bones'.": "欢迎光临 Bones'。",
  "Yeah, what the hell was that?": "对，那他妈是啥？",
  "Yeah, what was that?": "对啊，那是什么？",
  "Yeah, whatever.": "行，随你。",
  "Yeah, why buy something when you can just take up space for free?": "对啊，干嘛买东西啊，浪费空间？",
  "Yeah, why not.": "好啊，为什么不呢。",
  "Yeah, yeah, I know the drill.": "是啊，是啊，我知道该怎么做。",
  "Yeah, yeah, I saw it too.": "对，对，我也看见了。",
  "Yeah, yeah, I see you.": "知道了知道了，我看到你了。",
  "Yeah, yeah, take it easy.": "来，来，别急。",
  "Yeah, yeah, yeah go on, yes yes yes go on, go on!": "耶，耶，耶，走吧，走吧，走吧！",
  "Yeah, yeah, yeah, it'll be done soon.": "好的好的，很快就弄好了。",
  "Yeah, yeah, yeah. I'll get it finished. Just be patient.": "好好好，我会做完的，耐心点。",
  "Yeah, yeah. Aces.": "知道啦，王牌。",
  "Yeah, yeah. I get it. Hold on.": "好的，好的。我懂了，等一等。",
  "Yeah, yeah. I know you don't give a shit.": "哼，我就知道你不关心。",
  "Yeah, yeah. I see it.": "好吧好吧，我懂了。",
  "Yeah, you better get out of here...": "对，你最好离开这里了……",
  "Yeah, you don't want this kind of trouble.": "你可不想惹上这样的麻烦。",
  "Yeah, you got my shields, so what?": "哈，不过是一层护盾。那又怎样？",
  "Yeah, you might want to pace yourself and drink what you've got.": "嗯，你最好慢点，先把手上的喝完。",
  "Yeah, you owe me though.": "行，但是你欠我一次。",
  "Yeah, you pretend like you don't see me.": "行啊，就当没看到我一样。",
  "Yeah, you're real bad, hitting a ship that can't hit back.": "呵，你还真是坏的彻底，喜欢趁人之危。",
  "Yeah.": "好。",
  "Yeah. Come on. Come on. Come on.": "是的，就这样，加油，加油。",
  "Yeah. Great.": "好，很棒。",
  "Yeah. Hey.": "啊，你好。",
  "Yeah. Need some clean-up.": "对，需要打扫一下。",
  "Yeah. No problem.": "好的。没问题。",
  "Yeah. Sure.": "哦。是这样呢。",
  "Yeah. Thanks. That's really nice of you.": "嗯，谢谢，你人真好。",
  "Yeah. That was good.": "耶，太好了。",
  "Yeah. There we go.": "嘿嘿，就是这样。",
  "Yeah. Well hopefully a few rounds will improve your outlook.": "是的，希望喝几杯能让你脸色更好。",
  "Yeah. What was that?": "对啊，那是什么？",
  "Yeah. What's up?": "什么事？怎么了？",
  "Yeah. What.": "嗯，什么。",
  "Yeah. Yeah, yeah, I feel that.": "对对对，我也觉得。",
  "Yeah...": "对……",
  "Yeah... I won't.": "好好好...我不会忘的。",
  "Yeah... heard something.": "对……我听到有什么东西了。",
  "Yeah?": "是吗？",
  "Yeah? Screw you.": "啊？给老子滚。",
  "Yeah? What.": "诶？什么。",
  "Yeah? what?": "嗯？什么？",
