  "Yes, that was beautiful.": "耶！妙啊！",
  "Yes, this all seems to be in order. Thank you.": "嗯，看来一切都很不错。谢谢你。",
  "Yes, very nice. Very nice indeed.": "是的，非常好。确实非常好。",
  "Yes, yeah.": "好耶。",
  "Yes, yes, coming along nicely, yes.": "是的，是的，进展顺利，是的。",
  "Yes.": "是的。",
  "Yes. Could use useful, useful food. Very exciting. Bye.": "是的。可以用有用有用的食物。非常兴奋。再见。",
  "Yes. So happy to see you right now.": "是的，真高兴能现在见到你。",
  "Yes. Trade for favors. Happy to. Good luck. Bye.": "是的。交易人情。很乐意。祝你好运。再见。",
  "Yes. Yes. Come on by. Pad is ready.": "是的。是的。快来吧。停机坪准备好了。",
  "Yes....sir": "是。。长官",
  "Yesterday? Totally forgot to watch.": "昨天？完全忘看了。",
  "Yes… I think that complete. Very proud.": "是的……我觉得完成了。非常骄傲。",
