  "You What? What?!": "你想干嘛？咋地？",
  "You actually came. I thought you would, but still.": "你真的来了，我知道你回来但你的出现还是让我高兴。",
  "You again": "又是你。",
  "You again, huh?": "你又来了，嗯？",
  "You again...": "又是你...",
  "You again?": "又是你？",
  "You against me? What a joke.": "你要跟我打？开哪门子玩笑呢。",
  "You agree.": "你同意了。",
  "You ain't getting shit from me.": "你从我这什么也拿不到。",
  "You ain't gotta do this. Please. I got people waiting on me.": "你不会这样做吧，求你了，还有人在家等着我回去。",
  "You ain't shit?": "你是坨屎吧？",
  "You ain't worth dying over.": "不值得为了你送命。",
  "You ain't worth my time.": "你不值得浪费我的时间。",
  "You all deal with these CDF. Meet at the rendezvous.": "你们都去对付民事防御部队，在集合点集合。",
  "You all have been charged with violating local law and are under arrest.": "你们所有人都被控违反了当地法律，你们都被捕了。",
  "You all right there?": "你没事吧？",
  "You all right?": "你好？",
  "You all right? Got plenty on offer, so see what suits you.": "你还好吗？我们有很多选择，看看哪个适合你。",
  "You are NOT READY": "您尚未就绪",
  "You are READY": "您已准备就绪",
  "You are Victorious": "你赢了",
  "You are a damn efficient killing machine if I've ever seen one.": "你他妈简直就是一台我从未见过的高效杀人机器。",
  "You are a god send. Hold off these assholes while I do repairs.": "你简直就是上帝派来的。我修理的时候帮我拖住这帮混蛋。",
  "You are able to roll your ship by holding [~action(spaceship_movement|v_roll)].": "您可以通过保持 [~action(spaceship_movement|v_roll)] 来进行滚转操作。",
